#: src/data/moves_info.h:19
msgid ""
"This move can't be used.\n"
"Its effect is in development."
msgstr ""
"无法使用这个招式。\n"
"效果尚在开发中。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:47
msgid ""
"Pounds the foe with\n"
"forelegs or tail."
msgstr ""
"用长长的尾巴或前肢等\n"
"拍打对手进行攻击。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:70
msgid ""
"A chopping attack with a\n"
"high critical-hit ratio."
msgstr ""
"用锋利的手刀劈打对手。\n"
"容易击中要害。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:94
msgid ""
"Repeatedly slaps the foe\n"
"2 to 5 times."
msgstr ""
"用连续巴掌拍打对手，\n"
"连续攻击2～5次。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:118
msgid ""
"Repeatedly punches the foe\n"
"2 to 5 times."
msgstr ""
"用拳头怒涛般地殴打对手，\n"
"连续攻击2～5次。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:142
msgid ""
"A strong punch thrown with\n"
"incredible power."
msgstr ""
"用充满力量的拳头\n"
"攻击对手。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:166
msgid ""
"Throws coins at the foe.\n"
"Money is recovered after."
msgstr ""
"向对手投掷小金币攻击。\n"
"战斗后可以拿到钱。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:190
msgid ""
"A fiery punch that may burn\n"
"the foe."
msgstr ""
"用充满火焰的拳头攻击，\n"
"有时会让对手灼伤。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:250
msgid ""
"An electrified punch that\n"
"may paralyze the foe."
msgstr ""
"用充满电流的拳头攻击，\n"
"有时会让对手麻痹。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:278
msgid ""
"Scratches the foe with\n"
"sharp claws."
msgstr ""
"用坚硬且锋利的爪子\n"
"抓对手进行攻击。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:300
msgid ""
"Grips the foe with large and\n"
"powerful pincers."
msgstr ""
"用巨大而有力的钳子\n"
"夹住对手进行攻击。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:322
msgid ""
"A powerful pincer attack\n"
"that causes fainting."
msgstr ""
"用大钳子夹断对手。\n"
"命中的话就会一击濒死。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:382
msgid ""
"A fighting dance that\n"
"sharply raises Attack."
msgstr ""
"激烈地跳起战舞，\n"
"大幅提高自己的攻击。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:413
msgid ""
"Cuts the foe with sharp\n"
"scythes, claws, etc."
msgstr ""
"用镰刀或爪子等\n"
"切斩对手进行攻击。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:436
msgid ""
"Strikes the foe with a gust\n"
"of wind whipped up by wings."
msgstr ""
"用翅膀扇起强风，\n"
"吹向对手进行攻击。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:460
msgid ""
"Strikes the foe with wings\n"
"spread wide."
msgstr ""
"大大地展开美丽的翅膀，\n"
"撞向对手进行攻击。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:482
msgid ""
"Blows away the foe to switch\n"
"it out or end wild battles."
msgstr ""
"吹飞对手，强制换人。\n"
"野生宝可梦则战斗结束。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:522
msgid ""
"Flies up on the first turn,\n"
"then strikes the next turn."
msgstr ""
"第1回合飞上天空，\n"
"第2回合攻击对手。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:578
msgid ""
"Slams the foe with a long\n"
"tail, vine, etc."
msgstr ""
"用长长的尾巴或藤蔓等\n"
"摔打对手进行攻击。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:602
msgid ""
"Strikes the foe with\n"
"slender, whiplike vines."
msgstr ""
"用如同鞭子般弯曲而细长\n"
"的藤蔓摔打对手。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:630
msgid ""
"Stomps the enemy with a big\n"
"foot. May cause flinching."
msgstr ""
"用大脚踩踏对手攻击。\n"
"有时会使对手畏缩。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:659
msgid ""
"A double-kicking attack\n"
"that strikes the foe twice."
msgstr ""
"用2只脚踢倒对手\n"
"进行攻击。连续2次。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:683
msgid ""
"An extremely powerful kick\n"
"with intense force."
msgstr ""
"使出力量强大的飞踢\n"
"攻击对手。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:706
msgid ""
"A strong jumping kick. May\n"
"miss and hurt the kicker."
msgstr ""
"跳起来用膝盖踢对手。\n"
"落空的话自己会受伤。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:736
msgid ""
"A fast kick delivered from\n"
"a rapid spin. May flinch."
msgstr ""
"一边使身体快速旋转，\n"
"一边踢飞对手。可能畏缩。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:764
msgid ""
"Lowers the foe's accuracy\n"
"by hurling sand in its face."
msgstr ""
"向对手脸上泼沙子，\n"
"从而降低对手的命中率。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:792
msgid ""
"A ramming attack that may\n"
"cause flinching."
msgstr ""
"伸直头部撞向对手。\n"
"有时会使对手畏缩。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:819
msgid ""
"Jabs the foe with sharp\n"
"horns."
msgstr ""
"用尖锐的角\n"
"攻击对手。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:841
msgid ""
"Jabs the foe 2 to 5 times\n"
"with sharp horns, etc."
msgstr ""
"用角或喙刺向对手，\n"
"连续攻击2～5次。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:864
msgid ""
"A one-hit KO attack that\n"
"uses a horn like a drill."
msgstr ""
"用旋转的角刺入对手。\n"
"命中的话就会一击濒死。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:887
msgid ""
"Charges the foe with a full-\n"
"body tackle."
msgstr ""
"用整个身体\n"
"撞向对手进行攻击。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:915
msgid ""
"A full-body slam that may\n"
"cause paralysis."
msgstr ""
"用整个身体撞向对手。\n"
"有时会让对手麻痹。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:972
msgid ""
"A reckless charge attack\n"
"that also hurts the user."
msgstr ""
"以惊人的气势撞向对手。\n"
"自己也会受到少许伤害。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:996 src/data/moves_info.h:2159 src/data/moves_info.h:5490 src/data/moves_info.h:20140
msgid ""
"A rampage of 2 to 3 turns\n"
"that confuses the user."
msgstr ""
"在2～3回合内乱打一气\n"
"地攻击。之后自己会混乱。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:1024
msgid ""
"A life-risking tackle that\n"
"also hurts the user."
msgstr ""
"拼命地猛撞向对手。\n"
"自己也会受到不少伤害。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:1048
msgid ""
"Wags the tail to lower the\n"
"foes' Defense."
msgstr ""
"可爱地左右摇晃尾巴，\n"
"降低对手的防御。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:1075
msgid ""
"A toxic attack with barbs,\n"
"etc., that may poison."
msgstr ""
"将有毒的针刺入对手。\n"
"有时会让对手中毒。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:1100
msgid ""
"Stingers on the forelegs jab\n"
"the foe twice. May poison."
msgstr ""
"将2根针刺入对手，\n"
"连续2次。可能让对手中毒。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:1128
msgid ""
"Sharp pins are fired to\n"
"strike 2 to 5 times."
msgstr ""
"向对手发射锐针攻击，\n"
"连续攻击2～5次。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:1150
msgid ""
"Frightens the foes with a\n"
"leer to lower Defense."
msgstr ""
"用犀利的目光\n"
"降低对手的防御。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:1177
msgid ""
"Bites with vicious fangs.\n"
"May cause flinching."
msgstr ""
"用尖锐的牙咬住对手。\n"
"有时会使对手畏缩。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:1205
msgid ""
"Growls cutely to lower the\n"
"foes' Attack."
msgstr ""
"可爱地叫唤，\n"
"降低对手的攻击。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:1234
msgid ""
"The foe is scared to switch\n"
"it out or end wild battles."
msgstr ""
"放走对手，强制换人。\n"
"野生宝可梦则战斗结束。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:1269
msgid ""
"A soothing song lulls the\n"
"foe into a deep slumber."
msgstr ""
"让对手听舒适悦耳的\n"
"歌声，从而陷入睡眠。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:1296
msgid ""
"Emits bizarre sound waves\n"
"that confuse the foe."
msgstr ""
"从身体发出特殊的音波，\n"
"从而使对手混乱。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:1322
msgid ""
"Launches shock waves that\n"
"always inflict 20 HP damage."
msgstr ""
"向对手发出冲击波，\n"
"必定造成20HP的伤害。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:1413
msgid ""
"A weak fire attack that may\n"
"inflict a burn."
msgstr ""
"向对手发射小型火焰。\n"
"有时会让对手灼伤。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:1438
msgid ""
"A powerful fire attack that\n"
"may inflict a burn."
msgstr ""
"向对手发射烈焰。\n"
"有时会让对手灼伤。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:1464
msgid ""
"Creates a mist that stops\n"
"lowering of allies' stats."
msgstr ""
"用白雾覆盖己方，\n"
"防止能力被降低。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:1490
msgid ""
"Squirts water to attack\n"
"the foe."
msgstr ""
"向对手猛烈地喷射水流\n"
"进行攻击。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:1511
msgid ""
"Blasts water at high power\n"
"to strike the foe."
msgstr ""
"向对手猛烈地喷射\n"
"大量水流进行攻击。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:1625
msgid ""
"Fires a peculiar ray that\n"
"may confuse the foe."
msgstr ""
"向对手发射神奇的光线。\n"
"有时会使对手混乱。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:1651
msgid ""
"Forcefully sprays bubbles\n"
"that may lower Speed."
msgstr ""
"向对手猛烈地喷射泡沫。\n"
"有时会降低对手的速度。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:1677
msgid ""
"Fires a rainbow-colored\n"
"beam that may lower Attack."
msgstr ""
"向对手发射七彩光束。\n"
"有时会降低对手的攻击。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:1735
msgid ""
"Attacks the foe with a\n"
"jabbing beak, etc."
msgstr ""
"用尖锐的喙或角\n"
"戳对手进行攻击。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:1757
msgid ""
"A corkscrewing attack with\n"
"the beak acting as a drill."
msgstr ""
"一边旋转，一边将尖喙\n"
"像钻头一样刺进对手。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:1780
msgid ""
"A reckless body slam that\n"
"also hurts the user."
msgstr ""
"连同自己一起摔向地面。\n"
"自己也会受到少许伤害。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:1836
msgid ""
"Retaliates any physical hit\n"
"with double the power."
msgstr ""
"受到物理攻击时，\n"
"以2倍伤害还击对手。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:1870 src/data/moves_info.h:2726
msgid ""
"Inflicts damage identical\n"
"to the user's level."
msgstr ""
"给予对手和自己\n"
"等级相同的伤害。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:1894
msgid ""
"Builds enormous power,\n"
"then slams the foe."
msgstr ""
"使出浑身力气\n"
"殴打对手进行攻击。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:1917 src/data/moves_info.h:1944
msgid ""
"An attack that absorbs\n"
"half the damage inflicted."
msgstr ""
"吸取对手的养分攻击。\n"
"回复伤害一半的HP。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:1972
msgid ""
"Plants a seed on the foe to\n"
"steal HP on every turn."
msgstr ""
"植入寄生种子，每回合\n"
"吸取对手少许HP。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:2032
msgid ""
"Cuts enemies with leaves.\n"
"High critical-hit ratio."
msgstr ""
"飞叶为刃切斩对手。\n"
"容易击中要害。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:2056
msgid ""
"Absorbs light in one turn,\n"
"then attacks next turn."
msgstr ""
"第1回合收集满满的日光，\n"
"第2回合发射光束攻击。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:2081
msgid ""
"Scatters a toxic powder\n"
"that poisons the foe."
msgstr ""
"撒出毒粉，\n"
"从而让对手陷入中毒。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:2107
msgid ""
"Scatters a powder that\n"
"paralyzes the foe."
msgstr ""
"撒出麻痹粉，\n"
"从而让对手陷入麻痹。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:2133
msgid ""
"Scatters a powder that\n"
"causes the foe to sleep."
msgstr ""
"撒出催眠粉，\n"
"从而让对手陷入睡眠。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:2225
msgid ""
"Launches shock waves that\n"
"always inflict 40 HP damage."
msgstr ""
"向对手发出冲击波，\n"
"必定造成40HP的伤害。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:2276
msgid ""
"An electrical attack that\n"
"may paralyze the foe."
msgstr ""
"发出电流刺激对手。\n"
"有时会让对手麻痹。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:2301
msgid ""
"A strong electrical attack\n"
"that may paralyze the foe."
msgstr ""
"向对手发出强力电击。\n"
"有时会让对手麻痹。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:2327
msgid ""
"A weak jolt of electricity\n"
"that paralyzes the foe."
msgstr ""
"向对手发出微弱的电击，\n"
"从而让对手陷入麻痹。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:2352
msgid ""
"A lightning attack that may\n"
"cause paralysis."
msgstr ""
"向对手劈下暴雷。\n"
"有时会让对手麻痹。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:2381
msgid ""
"Throws small rocks to\n"
"strike the foe."
msgstr ""
"拿起小岩石，\n"
"投掷对手进行攻击。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:2402
msgid ""
"A powerful quake that\n"
"hits all other Pokémon."
msgstr ""
"利用地震的冲击，\n"
"攻击自己周围所有宝可梦。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:2427
msgid ""
"A one-hit KO move that\n"
"drops the foe in a fissure."
msgstr ""
"让对手掉落于地裂裂缝。\n"
"命中的话就会一击濒死。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:2451
msgid ""
"Digs underground the first\n"
"turn and strikes next turn."
msgstr ""
"第1回合钻入地下，\n"
"第2回合攻击对手。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:2485
msgid ""
"Poisons the foe with an\n"
"intensifying toxin."
msgstr ""
"让对手陷入剧毒状态。\n"
"中毒伤害逐渐增加。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:2511
msgid ""
"A psychic attack that may\n"
"cause confusion."
msgstr ""
"向对手发送微弱的念力。\n"
"有时会使对手混乱。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:2536
msgid ""
"A powerful psychic attack\n"
"that may lower Sp. Def."
msgstr ""
"向对手发送强大的念力。\n"
"有时会降低对手的特防。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:2563
msgid ""
"A hypnotizing move that\n"
"induces sleep."
msgstr ""
"施以诱导睡意的暗示，\n"
"让对手陷入睡眠。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:2588
msgid ""
"Meditates in a peaceful\n"
"fashion to raise Attack."
msgstr ""
"唤醒自身深处沉睡的力量，\n"
"从而提高自己的攻击。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:2618
msgid ""
"Relaxes the body to sharply\n"
"raise Speed."
msgstr ""
"放松身体，\n"
"大幅提高自己的速度。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:2648
msgid ""
"An extremely fast attack\n"
"that always strikes first."
msgstr ""
"以迅雷不及掩耳之势\n"
"扑向对手。必定能够先制。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:2671
msgid ""
"Raises the user's Attack\n"
"every time it is hit."
msgstr ""
"愤怒的火焰燃起，\n"
"每受到攻击时攻击会提高。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:2748
msgid ""
"Copies the last move used by\n"
"the foe during one battle."
msgstr ""
"在战斗中模仿对手\n"
"最后使用的招式。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:2779
msgid ""
"Emits a screech to harshly\n"
"lower the foe's Defense."
msgstr ""
"发出尖锐的声音，\n"
"大幅降低对手的防御。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:2809
msgid ""
"Creates illusory copies to\n"
"raise evasiveness."
msgstr ""
"快速移动制造分身，\n"
"提高自己的闪避率。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:2839 src/data/moves_info.h:3675 src/data/moves_info.h:5713
msgid ""
"Recovers up to half the\n"
"user's maximum HP."
msgstr ""
"让细胞再生，\n"
"回复自己最大HP的一半。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:2872
msgid ""
"Stiffens the body's \n"
"muscles to raise Defense."
msgstr ""
"全身使劲，\n"
"提高自己的防御。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:2936
msgid ""
"Lowers the foe's accuracy\n"
"using smoke, ink, etc."
msgstr ""
"用烟雾或墨汁遮住对手，\n"
"降低对手的命中率。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:2964
msgid ""
"A sinister ray that\n"
"confuses the foe."
msgstr ""
"发出奇怪的光，\n"
"扰乱对手使其混乱。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:2988
msgid ""
"Withdraws the body into its\n"
"hard shell to raise Defense."
msgstr ""
"缩入壳里保护身体，\n"
"提高自己的防御。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:3018
msgid ""
"Curls up to conceal weak\n"
"spots and raise Defense."
msgstr ""
"将身体蜷曲起来防御，\n"
"提高自己的防御。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:3048
msgid ""
"Creates a barrier that\n"
"sharply raises Defense."
msgstr ""
"制造坚固的壁障，\n"
"大幅提高自己的防御。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:3078
msgid ""
"For 5 turns, a wall of light\n"
"reduces special damage."
msgstr ""
"5回合内利用神奇的壁障，\n"
"减弱受到的特殊攻击。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:3104
msgid ""
"Creates a black haze that\n"
"eliminates all stat changes."
msgstr ""
"喷出黑雾，\n"
"让场上全员的能力复原。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:3130
msgid ""
"For 5 turns, a wall of light\n"
"weakens physical attacks."
msgstr ""
"5回合内利用神奇的壁障，\n"
"减弱受到的物理攻击。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:3156
msgid ""
"Focuses power to raise the\n"
"critical-hit ratio."
msgstr ""
"深深地吸口气，集中精神。\n"
"自己的攻击更易击中要害。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:3183
msgid ""
"Endures attack for 2\n"
"turns to retaliate double."
msgstr ""
"2回合内忍受攻击，\n"
"之后加倍奉还受到的伤害。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:3208
msgid ""
"Waggles a finger to use any\n"
"Pokémon move at random."
msgstr ""
"摇晃手指刺激大脑，\n"
"随机使出任意招式。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:3239
msgid ""
"Counters the foe's attack\n"
"with the same move."
msgstr ""
"模仿对手使用的招式，\n"
"自己也使用相同招式。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:3271 src/data/moves_info.h:4189
msgid ""
"Inflicts severe damage but\n"
"makes the user faint."
msgstr ""
"引发爆炸造成巨大伤害，\n"
"使用后自己会陷入濒死。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:3296
msgid ""
"An egg is forcibly hurled at\n"
"the foe."
msgstr ""
"使出浑身力气，\n"
"将大蛋扔向对手攻击。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:3319
msgid ""
"Licks with a long tongue to\n"
"injure. May also paralyze."
msgstr ""
"用长长的舌头舔遍对手。\n"
"有时会让对手麻痹。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:3346
msgid ""
"An exhaust-gas attack\n"
"that may also poison."
msgstr ""
"将毒气吹到对手身上。\n"
"有时会让对手中毒。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:3371 src/data/moves_info.h:5164
msgid ""
"Sludge is hurled to inflict\n"
"damage. May also poison."
msgstr ""
"将污泥投掷向对手攻击。\n"
"有时会让对手中毒。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:3396
msgid ""
"Clubs the foe with a bone.\n"
"May cause flinching."
msgstr ""
"用手中的骨头殴打对手。\n"
"有时会使对手畏缩。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:3421
msgid ""
"Incinerates everything it\n"
"strikes. May cause a burn."
msgstr ""
"用大字形的火焰烧尽对手。\n"
"有时会让对手灼伤。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:3448
msgid ""
"Charges with speed to\n"
"climb waterfalls. May flinch."
msgstr ""
"以惊人的气势扑向对手。\n"
"有时会使对手畏缩。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:3456
msgid ""
"Charges the foe with speed\n"
"to climb waterfalls."
msgstr ""
"以惊人的气势\n"
"扑向对手进行攻击。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:3508
msgid ""
"Sprays star-shaped rays\n"
"that never miss."
msgstr ""
"发射星形的光攻击对手。\n"
"攻击必定会命中。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:3531
msgid ""
"Tucks in to raise Defense,\n"
"then attacks the next turn."
msgstr ""
"第1回合缩头提高防御，\n"
"第2回合撞向对手。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:3541
msgid ""
"Tucks in the head, then\n"
"attacks on the next turn."
msgstr ""
"第1回合把头缩进去，\n"
"第2回合撞向对手。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:3568
msgid ""
"Launches sharp spikes that\n"
"strike 2 to 5 times."
msgstr ""
"向对手发射锐针，\n"
"连续攻击2～5次。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:3590
msgid ""
"Constricts to inflict pain.\n"
"May lower Speed."
msgstr ""
"用触手或青藤等缠住对手。\n"
"有时会降低对手的速度。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:3617
msgid ""
"Forgets about something\n"
"and sharply raises Sp. Def."
msgstr ""
"将头脑放空，\n"
"大幅提高自己的特防。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:3647
msgid ""
"Distracts the foe.\n"
"Lowers accuracy."
msgstr ""
"歪曲汤匙引开注意，\n"
"降低对手的命中率。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:3702
msgid ""
"A jumping knee kick. If it\n"
"misses, the user is hurt."
msgstr ""
"跳起来用膝盖撞对手。\n"
"落空的话自己会受伤。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:3732
msgid ""
"Intimidates and frightens\n"
"the foe into paralysis."
msgstr ""
"用腹部的花纹使对手害怕，\n"
"从而让其陷入麻痹。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:3763
msgid ""
"Absorbs one half the damage\n"
"inflicted on a sleeping foe."
msgstr ""
"吃掉睡眠对手的梦攻击。\n"
"回复伤害一半的HP。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:3824
msgid ""
"Hurls round objects at the\n"
"foe 2 to 5 times."
msgstr ""
"向对手投掷圆形物体，\n"
"连续攻击2～5次。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:3847 src/data/moves_info.h:5545
msgid ""
"An attack that steals half\n"
"the damage inflicted."
msgstr ""
"吸取对手的血液攻击。\n"
"回复伤害一半的HP。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:3875
msgid ""
"Demands a kiss with a scary\n"
"face that induces sleep."
msgstr ""
"用恐怖的脸亲吻对手，\n"
"让对手陷入睡眠。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:3901
msgid ""
"2-turn move. May flinch and\n"
"has a high critical-hit rate."
msgstr ""
"2回合攻击。可能使对手\n"
"畏缩，容易击中要害。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:3909
msgid ""
"Searches out weak spots,\n"
"then strikes the next turn."
msgstr ""
"看穿对手的弱点，\n"
"第2回合再攻击对手。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:3936
msgid ""
"Alters the user's cells to\n"
"become a copy of the foe."
msgstr ""
"变身成对手宝可梦，\n"
"能够使用和对手相同的招式。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:3968
msgid ""
"An attack using bubbles.\n"
"May lower the foes' Speed."
msgstr ""
"将无数泡泡吹向对手。\n"
"有时会降低对手的速度。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:3995
msgid ""
"A rhythmic punch that may\n"
"confuse the foe."
msgstr ""
"有节奏地挥动拳头。\n"
"有时会使对手混乱。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:4003
msgid ""
"The foe is hit with a\n"
"rhythmic punch."
msgstr ""
"有节奏地挥动拳头\n"
"殴打对手。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:4028
msgid ""
"Scatters a cloud of spores\n"
"that always induce sleep."
msgstr ""
"撒满有催眠效果的孢子，\n"
"使对手必定陷入睡眠。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:4054
msgid ""
"Looses a powerful blast of\n"
"light that lowers accuracy."
msgstr ""
"使出耀眼的强光，\n"
"降低对手的命中率。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:4082
msgid ""
"Attacks with a psychic\n"
"wave of varying intensity."
msgstr ""
"向对手施以奇妙的念波，\n"
"威力每次都会不同。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:4104
msgid ""
"It's just a splash...\n"
"Has no effect whatsoever."
msgstr ""
"只是在地面上蹦蹦跳跳，\n"
"什么效果都没有……"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:4129
msgid ""
"Liquifies the user's body\n"
"to sharply raise Defense."
msgstr ""
"让细胞变化成液态，\n"
"大幅提高自己的防御。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:4159
msgid ""
"Hammers with a pincer. Has a\n"
"high critical-hit ratio."
msgstr ""
"用大钳子敲打对手。\n"
"容易击中要害。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:4214
msgid ""
"Rakes the foe with sharp\n"
"claws, etc., 2 to 5 times."
msgstr ""
"用爪子或镰刀抓对手，\n"
"连续攻击2～5次。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:4237
msgid ""
"Throws a bone boomerang\n"
"that strikes twice."
msgstr ""
"用手中的骨头投掷对手，\n"
"来回连续攻击2次。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:4260
msgid ""
"The user sleeps for 2 turns,\n"
"restoring HP and status."
msgstr ""
"连续睡2回合，回复自己的\n"
"HP和所有异常状态。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:4288
msgid ""
"Large boulders are hurled.\n"
"May cause flinching."
msgstr ""
"将大岩石猛烈地撞向对手。\n"
"有时会使对手畏缩。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:4296
msgid ""
"Hits the foes with an\n"
"avalanche of boulders."
msgstr ""
"将大岩石\n"
"猛烈地撞向对手攻击。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:4319
msgid ""
"Attacks with sharp fangs.\n"
"May cause flinching."
msgstr ""
"用锋利的门牙咬住对手。\n"
"有时会使对手畏缩。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:4347
msgid ""
"Reduces the polygon count\n"
"and raises Attack."
msgstr ""
"使身体变得棱角分明，\n"
"从而提高自己的攻击。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:4409
msgid ""
"Fires three types of beams.\n"
"May burn/parlyz/frostbite."
msgstr ""
"发射3种光线。可能灼伤、\n"
"麻痹或冻伤对手。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:4413
msgid ""
"Fires three types of beams.\n"
"May burn/paralyze/freeze."
msgstr ""
"发射3种光线。可能灼伤、\n"
"麻痹或冰冻对手。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:4423
msgid ""
"A triangular field of energy\n"
"is created and launched."
msgstr ""
"制造出三角形的能量场，\n"
"向对手发射攻击。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:4446
msgid ""
"Attacks with sharp fangs\n"
"and cuts half the foe's HP."
msgstr ""
"用锋利的门牙\n"
"使对手的HP减半。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:4471
msgid ""
"Slashes with claws, etc. Has\n"
"a high critical-hit ratio."
msgstr ""
"用爪子或镰刀等劈开对手。\n"
"容易击中要害。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:4496
msgid ""
"Creates a decoy using 1/4\n"
"of the user's maximum HP."
msgstr ""
"削减自己最大HP的1/4\n"
"制造分身。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:4523
msgid ""
"Used only if all PP are gone.\n"
"Also hurts the user a little."
msgstr ""
"PP耗尽时才会使用。\n"
"自己也会受到少许伤害。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:4564
msgid ""
"Copies the foe's last move\n"
"permanently."
msgstr ""
"将对手最后使用的招式\n"
"永久变为自己的招式。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:4598
msgid ""
"Kicks the foe 3 times in a\n"
"row with rising intensity."
msgstr ""
"连续3次踢对手攻击。\n"
"每次命中时威力都会提高。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:4622
msgid ""
"While attacking, it\n"
"steals the foe's held item."
msgstr ""
"攻击的同时\n"
"盗取对手的道具。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:4650
msgid ""
"Ensnares the foe to stop it\n"
"from fleeing or switching."
msgstr ""
"用黏糊糊的细丝缠住对手，\n"
"使其不能逃走或替换。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:4675
msgid ""
"Senses the foe's action to\n"
"ensure the next move's hit."
msgstr ""
"看穿对手的行动，\n"
"下次攻击必定会命中。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:4698
msgid ""
"Inflicts 1/4 damage on a\n"
"sleeping foe every turn."
msgstr ""
"让睡眠的对手做噩梦，\n"
"每回合减少1/4的HP。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:4722
msgid ""
"A fiery charge attack that\n"
"may inflict a burn."
msgstr ""
"让火焰覆盖全身猛撞对手。\n"
"有时会让对手灼伤。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:4749
msgid ""
"A loud move that can be used\n"
"only while asleep. May flinch."
msgstr ""
"睡眠时才能使用，发出\n"
"巨大鼾声。可能使对手畏缩。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:4778
msgid ""
"A move that functions\n"
"differently for Ghosts."
msgstr ""
"幽灵属性和其他属性\n"
"使用时效果不同。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:4813 src/data/moves_info.h:4919
msgid ""
"Inflicts more damage when\n"
"the user's HP is down."
msgstr ""
"自己的HP越少，\n"
"给予对手的伤害越大。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:4836
msgid ""
"Makes the user resistant\n"
"to the last attack's type."
msgstr ""
"使自己变成能抵抗\n"
"对手上次所用招式的属性。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:4862
msgid ""
"Launches a vacuumed blast.\n"
"High critical-hit ratio."
msgstr ""
"发射空气漩涡攻击对手。\n"
"容易击中要害。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:5000 src/data/moves_info.h:5410 src/data/moves_info.h:22722
msgid ""
"Evades attack, but may fail\n"
"if used in succession."
msgstr ""
"完全抵挡对手的攻击。\n"
"连续使用容易失败。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:5035
msgid ""
"A punch is thrown at wicked\n"
"speed to strike first."
msgstr ""
"迅速挥出拳头，\n"
"必定能够先制攻击。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:5059
msgid ""
"Frightens with a scary face\n"
"to harshly lower Speed."
msgstr ""
"用恐怖的表情瞪着对手，\n"
"大幅降低其速度。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:5087
msgid ""
"Draws the foe close, then\n"
"strikes without fail."
msgstr ""
"悄悄接近对手攻击。\n"
"攻击必定会命中。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:5110
msgid ""
"Demands a kiss with a cute\n"
"look. Causes confusion."
msgstr ""
"像小天使一样可爱地亲吻\n"
"对手，从而使对手混乱。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:5134
msgid ""
"Maximizes Attack while\n"
"sacrificing half the max HP."
msgstr ""
"削减自己最大HP的一半，\n"
"将攻击提升至最大。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:5191
msgid ""
"Hurls mud in the foe's face\n"
"to lower its accuracy."
msgstr ""
"向对手脸上扔泥巴攻击，\n"
"同时降低其命中率。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:5218
msgid ""
"Fires a lump of ink to\n"
"damage. May lower accuracy."
msgstr ""
"向对手的脸喷出墨汁攻击。\n"
"有时会降低对手的命中率。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:5246
msgid ""
"Sets spikes that hurt a \n"
"foe switching in."
msgstr ""
"撒下撒菱，让替换出场的\n"
"对手受到伤害。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:5274
msgid ""
"Powerful and sure to cause\n"
"paralysis, but inaccurate."
msgstr ""
"发射大炮般的电流攻击，\n"
"让对手必定麻痹。命中低。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:5301 src/data/moves_info.h:8690
msgid ""
"Negates evasion and the\n"
"Ghost type's immunities."
msgstr ""
"使对手的闪避率无效，\n"
"幽灵属性也能被击中。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:5326
msgid ""
"If the user faints, the foe\n"
"is also made to faint."
msgstr ""
"自己濒死时，\n"
"攻击自己的对手也会濒死。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:5355
msgid ""
"Any Pokémon hearing this\n"
"song faints in 3 turns."
msgstr ""
"听到灭亡之歌的宝可梦\n"
"经过3回合后就会濒死。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:5382
msgid ""
"A chilling attack that\n"
"lowers the foes' Speed."
msgstr ""
"将冰冻的冷气吹向对手，\n"
"从而降低对手的速度。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:5445
msgid ""
"Strikes the foe with a bone\n"
"in hand 2 to 5 times."
msgstr ""
"用坚硬的骨头殴打对手，\n"
"连续攻击2～5次。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:5467
msgid ""
"Locks on to the foe to\n"
"ensure the next move hits."
msgstr ""
"锁定目标，\n"
"下次攻击必定会命中。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:5518
msgid ""
"Causes a sandstorm that\n"
"rages for 5 turns."
msgstr ""
"5回合内扬起沙暴。\n"
"除特定属性外都会受伤。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:5573
msgid ""
"Endures any attack for\n"
"1 turn, leaving at least 1 HP."
msgstr ""
"即使受到攻击，\n"
"也至少能保留1HP。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:5608
msgid ""
"Charms the foe and harshly\n"
"lowers its Attack."
msgstr ""
"可爱地撒娇，\n"
"大幅降低对手的攻击。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:5636
msgid ""
"An attack lasting 5 turns\n"
"with rising intensity."
msgstr ""
"在5回合内连续滚动撞击，\n"
"威力会逐渐提高。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:5661 src/data/moves_info.h:16321
msgid ""
"An attack that leaves the\n"
"foe with at least 1 HP."
msgstr ""
"手下留情攻击对手，\n"
"让对手至少保留1HP。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:5684
msgid ""
"Confuses the foe, but also\n"
"sharply raises its Attack."
msgstr ""
"激怒对手使其混乱，\n"
"但会大幅提高其攻击。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:5740
msgid ""
"An electrified tackle that\n"
"may paralyze the foe."
msgstr ""
"让电流覆盖全身撞向对手。\n"
"有时会让对手麻痹。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:5766
msgid ""
"An attack that intensifies\n"
"on each successive hit."
msgstr ""
"用镰刀或爪子等切斩对手。\n"
"连续命中时威力提高。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:5796
msgid ""
"Strikes the foe with hard\n"
"wings. May raise Defense."
msgstr ""
"用坚硬的翅膀攻击对手。\n"
"有时会提高自己的防御。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:5826
msgid ""
"Fixes the foe with a mean\n"
"look that prevents escape."
msgstr ""
"用黑色的眼神死死盯住\n"
"对手，使其不能逃走。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:5851
msgid ""
"Makes the opposite gender\n"
"less likely to attack."
msgstr ""
"魅惑异性，使对手\n"
"变得难以使出招式。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:5876
msgid ""
"Uses an available move\n"
"randomly while asleep."
msgstr ""
"从自己已学会的招式中\n"
"随机使出1个。睡眠时用。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:5908
msgid ""
"Chimes soothingly to heal\n"
"the party's status problems."
msgstr ""
"让对手听舒适的铃声，\n"
"治愈我方全员的异常状态。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:5936
msgid ""
"An attack that increases\n"
"in power with friendship."
msgstr ""
"攻击的威力会随亲密度\n"
"增加而提高。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:5959
msgid ""
"A gift in the form of a\n"
"bomb. May restore HP."
msgstr ""
"向对手递送装有炸弹的\n"
"礼物。有时会回复其HP。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:5982
msgid ""
"An attack that is stronger\n"
"if the Trainer is disliked."
msgstr ""
"攻击的威力会随亲密度\n"
"降低而提高。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:6005
msgid ""
"Protects allies from status\n"
"problems for 5 turns."
msgstr ""
"5回合内被神奇力量守护，\n"
"不会陷入异常状态。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:6031
msgid ""
"Adds the user and foe's HP,\n"
"then shares them equally."
msgstr ""
"将自己和对手的HP相加，\n"
"再平分给双方。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:6054
msgid ""
"A mystical fire attack that\n"
"may inflict a burn."
msgstr ""
"用神圣的火焰攻击对手。\n"
"有时会让对手灼伤。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:6081
msgid ""
"A ground-shaking attack\n"
"of random intensity."
msgstr ""
"晃动地面，攻击周围所有\n"
"宝可梦。威力随机变化。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:6104
msgid ""
"Powerful and sure to cause\n"
"confusion, but inaccurate."
msgstr ""
"用力挥出拳头攻击对手。\n"
"必定混乱，但命中率低。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:6132
msgid ""
"A brutal ramming attack\n"
"using out-thrust horns."
msgstr ""
"用坚硬且华丽的角\n"
"猛烈地刺入对手进行攻击。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:6155
msgid ""
"Strikes the foe with a blast\n"
"of breath. May paralyze."
msgstr ""
"将强烈的气息吹向对手。\n"
"有时会让对手麻痹。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:6182
msgid ""
"Switches out the user while\n"
"keeping effects in play."
msgstr ""
"和替补宝可梦替换，\n"
"能力变化等状态会被继承。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:6241
msgid ""
"Inflicts double damage if\n"
"used on a foe switching out."
msgstr ""
"对手替换宝可梦时使用的话，\n"
"能造成2倍的伤害。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:6266
msgid ""
"Spins to remove traps\n"
"and raise Speed."
msgstr ""
"旋转身体解除束缚等效果，\n"
"还能提高自己的速度。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:6276
msgid ""
"Spins the body at high\n"
"speed to remove traps."
msgstr ""
"高速旋转身体，\n"
"解除束缚或撒菱等效果。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:6333
msgid ""
"Attacks with a rock-hard\n"
"tail. May lower Defense."
msgstr ""
"用坚硬的尾巴摔打对手。\n"
"有时会降低对手的防御。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:6361
msgid ""
"A claw attack that may\n"
"raise the user's Attack."
msgstr ""
"用钢铁之爪劈开对手。\n"
"有时会提高自己的攻击。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:6391
msgid ""
"Makes the user's move last,\n"
"but it never misses."
msgstr ""
"会最后出手，\n"
"但攻击必定会命中。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:6414 src/data/moves_info.h:6441 src/data/moves_info.h:6468
msgid ""
"Restores HP. The amount\n"
"varies with the weather."
msgstr ""
"回复自己的HP。\n"
"回复量随天气而改变。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:6495
msgid ""
"The effectiveness varies\n"
"with the user."
msgstr ""
"招式的属性会随着\n"
"使用者的不同而改变。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:6517
msgid ""
"A double-chopping attack.\n"
"High critical-hit ratio."
msgstr ""
"用两手交叉劈向对手。\n"
"容易击中要害。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:6541
msgid ""
"Whips up a vicious twister\n"
"to tear at foes. May flinch."
msgstr ""
"掀起龙卷风撕裂对手。\n"
"有时会使对手畏缩。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:6569
msgid ""
"Boosts the power of Water-\n"
"type moves for 5 turns."
msgstr ""
"5回合内降大雨，\n"
"提高水属性招式的威力。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:6595
msgid ""
"Boosts the power of Fire-\n"
"type moves for 5 turns."
msgstr ""
"5回合内阳光强烈，\n"
"提高火属性招式的威力。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:6655
msgid ""
"Counters the foe's special\n"
"attack at double the power."
msgstr ""
"受到特殊攻击时，\n"
"以2倍伤害还击对手。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:6687
msgid ""
"Copies foe's stat changes\n"
"and gives to the user."
msgstr ""
"向对手施加自我暗示，\n"
"复制对手的能力变化。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:6714
msgid ""
"An extremely powerful\n"
"attack. Always goes first."
msgstr ""
"以惊人的速度撞向对手。\n"
"必定能够先制攻击。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:6737
msgid ""
"An attack that may raise\n"
"all stats."
msgstr ""
"用远古之力攻击。\n"
"有时会提高自己全部能力。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:6770
msgid ""
"Hurls a black blob that may\n"
"lower the foe's Sp. Def."
msgstr ""
"投掷黑影之团攻击对手。\n"
"有时会降低对手的特防。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:6798
msgid ""
"Heightens inner power to\n"
"strike 2 turns later."
msgstr ""
"提高念力，\n"
"2回合后攻击对手。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:6828
msgid ""
"A rock-crushing attack\n"
"that may lower Defense."
msgstr ""
"用拳头击碎对手。\n"
"有时会降低对手的防御。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:6884
msgid ""
"Summons party Pokémon to\n"
"join in the attack."
msgstr ""
"我方全员参与攻击。\n"
"宝可梦越多，攻击次数越多。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:6911
msgid ""
"A 1st-turn only, 1st-strike\n"
"move that causes flinching."
msgstr ""
"出场后第1回合才能使用，\n"
"先制攻击使对手畏缩。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:7009
msgid ""
"Releases stockpiled power\n"
"(the more the better)."
msgstr ""
"将蓄积起来的力量发射\n"
"出去。蓄力越多威力越大。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:7032
msgid ""
"Absorbs stockpiled power\n"
"and restores HP."
msgstr ""
"将蓄积起来的力量吞下，\n"
"从而回复自己的HP。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:7059
msgid ""
"Exhales a hot breath on the\n"
"foes. May inflict a burn."
msgstr ""
"将炎热的气息吹向对手。\n"
"有时会让对手灼伤。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:7117
msgid ""
"Torments the foe and stops\n"
"successive use of a move."
msgstr ""
"向对手无理取闹，\n"
"令其不能连续使用相同招式。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:7141
msgid ""
"Confuses the foe, but\n"
"sharply raises its Sp. Atk."
msgstr ""
"吹捧对手使其混乱，\n"
"但会大幅提高其特攻。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:7169
msgid ""
"Inflicts a burn on the foe\n"
"with intense fire."
msgstr ""
"放出不吉利的火焰，\n"
"让对手陷入灼伤状态。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:7194
msgid ""
"The user faints and harshly\n"
"lowers the foe's offenses."
msgstr ""
"自己濒死，大幅降低\n"
"对手的攻击和特攻。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:7222
msgid ""
"Boosts power when burned,\n"
"paralyzed, or poisoned."
msgstr ""
"当自己处于中毒、麻痹、\n"
"灼伤状态时，威力会翻倍。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:7245
msgid ""
"Focuses before launching.\n"
"Fails if the user if hit."
msgstr ""
"集中精神后出拳。\n"
"受到攻击时会失败。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:7276
msgid ""
"Powerful against a paralyzed\n"
"foe, but also heals it."
msgstr ""
"对麻痹的对手威力翻倍，\n"
"但会治愈对手的麻痹。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:7303
msgid ""
"Draws attention to make\n"
"foes attack only the user."
msgstr ""
"引起对手的注意，\n"
"使对手只攻击自己。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:7331
msgid ""
"The type of attack varies\n"
"depending on the location."
msgstr ""
"利用自然之力进行攻击。\n"
"招式会随场所而改变。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:7364
msgid ""
"Ups the user's next Electric\n"
"move. It also raises Sp. Def."
msgstr ""
"强化下次使用的电属性\n"
"招式，同时提高特防。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:7368
msgid ""
"Charges power to boost the\n"
"Electric move used next."
msgstr ""
"充电强化下次使用的\n"
"电属性招式的威力。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:7374
msgid ""
"Ups the user's next move if\n"
"Electric. Also raises Sp. Def."
msgstr ""
"下次使用电属性招式时\n"
"威力提高，同时提高特防。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:7378
msgid ""
"Charges power to boost the\n"
"Electric move used next turn."
msgstr ""
"充电强化下回合使用的\n"
"电属性招式的威力。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:7444
msgid ""
"Boosts the power of an\n"
"ally's move."
msgstr ""
"辅助伙伴，\n"
"提高伙伴招式的威力。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:7473
msgid ""
"Tricks the foe into trading\n"
"held items."
msgstr ""
"趁对手不注意时，\n"
"交换自己与对手的道具。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:7499
msgid ""
"Mimics the target and\n"
"copies its Ability."
msgstr ""
"模仿对手，\n"
"让自己的特性变得和对手相同。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:7525
msgid ""
"A wish that restores HP.\n"
"It takes one turn to work."
msgstr ""
"在下一回合结束时，\n"
"回复HP。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:7552
msgid ""
"Attacks randomly with one\n"
"of the party's moves."
msgstr ""
"随机使用我方宝可梦\n"
"所学会的招式。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:7583
msgid ""
"Lays roots that restore HP.\n"
"The user can't switch out."
msgstr ""
"扎下根来回复HP，\n"
"但自己无法替换下场。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:7610
msgid ""
"Powerful, but it lowers the\n"
"user's Attack and Defense."
msgstr ""
"发挥惊人力量攻击。自己\n"
"的攻击和防御会降低。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:7639
msgid ""
"Reflects special effects\n"
"back to the attacker."
msgstr ""
"将对手使出的变化招式\n"
"反弹给对手。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:7664
msgid ""
"Recycles a used item for\n"
"one more use."
msgstr ""
"使战斗中已经消耗掉的\n"
"道具再生，能再次使用。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:7690 src/data/moves_info.h:11358
msgid ""
"An attack that gains power\n"
"if injured by the foe."
msgstr ""
"如果受到对手的攻击，\n"
"威力就会翻倍。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:7713
msgid ""
"Destroys barriers such as\n"
"Reflect and causes damage."
msgstr ""
"挥下手刀攻击对手，\n"
"还可以破坏光墙和反射壁。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:7740
msgid ""
"Lulls the foe into yawning,\n"
"then sleeping next turn."
msgstr ""
"打个大哈欠引起睡意，\n"
"下回合让对手陷入睡眠。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:7793
msgid ""
"Cuts down the foe's HP\n"
"to equal the user's HP."
msgstr ""
"使对手的HP\n"
"减少到和自己相同。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:7817 src/data/moves_info.h:19826
msgid ""
"The higher the user's HP,\n"
"the more damage caused."
msgstr ""
"自己的HP越多，\n"
"给予对手的伤害越大。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:7839
msgid ""
"The user swaps\n"
"Abilities with the target."
msgstr ""
"利用超能力，\n"
"互换自己和对手的特性。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:7863
msgid ""
"Prevents foes from using\n"
"moves known by the user."
msgstr ""
"对手不能使用\n"
"和自己相同的招式。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:7891
msgid ""
"Heals poisoning, paralysis,\n"
"or a burn."
msgstr ""
"治愈自己的中毒、\n"
"麻痹、灼伤状态。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:7917
msgid ""
"If the user faints, deletes\n"
"all PP of foe's last move."
msgstr ""
"因对手的招式而濒死时，\n"
"让该招式的PP变成0。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:7943
msgid ""
"Steals the next healing\n"
"or stat-changing move."
msgstr ""
"抢夺对手打算使用的\n"
"回复或能力变化招式。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:7973
msgid ""
"An attack with effects\n"
"that vary by location."
msgstr ""
"根据使用场所不同，\n"
"追加效果也会有所变化。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:7999
msgid ""
"Dives underwater the first\n"
"turn and strikes next turn."
msgstr ""
"第1回合潜入水中，\n"
"第2回合浮上来攻击。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:8027
msgid ""
"Straight-arm punches that\n"
"strike the foe 2 to 5 times."
msgstr ""
"用伸直的手掌冲打对手，\n"
"连续攻击2～5次。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:8050
msgid ""
"Alters the Pokémon's type\n"
"depending on the location."
msgstr ""
"根据所在场所不同，\n"
"改变自己的属性。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:8111
msgid ""
"Attacks with a burst of\n"
"light. May lower Sp. Def."
msgstr ""
"放出耀眼的光芒攻击。\n"
"有时会降低对手的特防。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:8138
msgid ""
"Attacks with a flurry of\n"
"down. May lower Sp. Atk."
msgstr ""
"用羽毛般的雾气攻击。\n"
"有时会降低对手的特攻。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:8166
msgid ""
"Envelops the foe with down\n"
"to harshly lower Attack."
msgstr ""
"用大量羽毛缠住对手，\n"
"大幅降低对手的攻击。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:8195
msgid "Confuses all others."
msgstr ""
"左右摇晃着跳舞，\n"
"让周围所有宝可梦混乱。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:8219
msgid ""
"A kick with a high critical-\n"
"hit ratio. May cause a burn."
msgstr ""
"踢出带火的脚。容易击中\n"
"要害，可能让对手灼伤。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:8278
msgid ""
"A 5-turn attack that gains\n"
"power on successive hits."
msgstr ""
"在5回合内连续滚动冰球\n"
"攻击，威力会逐渐提高。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:8303
msgid ""
"Attacks with thorny arms.\n"
"May cause flinching."
msgstr ""
"用带刺的手臂猛烈挥打。\n"
"有时会使对手畏缩。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:8331
msgid ""
"Slacks off and restores\n"
"half the maximum HP."
msgstr ""
"偷懒休息，\n"
"回复自己最大HP的一半。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:8358
msgid ""
"A loud attack that uses\n"
"sound waves to injure."
msgstr ""
"发出大声吼叫，\n"
"用音波攻击对手。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:8382
msgid ""
"A sharp-fanged attack.\n"
"May badly poison the foe."
msgstr ""
"用有毒的牙齿咬对手。\n"
"有时会让对手中剧毒。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:8409
msgid ""
"Tears at the foe with sharp\n"
"claws. May lower Defense."
msgstr ""
"用坚硬的利爪劈开对手。\n"
"有时会降低对手的防御。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:8500
msgid ""
"Fires a meteor-like punch.\n"
"May raise Attack."
msgstr ""
"使出彗星般的拳头攻击。\n"
"有时会提高自己的攻击。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:8530
msgid ""
"An attack that may shock\n"
"the foe into flinching."
msgstr ""
"大声惊吓对手攻击。\n"
"有时会使对手畏缩。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:8558
msgid ""
"The move's type and power\n"
"change with the weather."
msgstr ""
"属性和威力会\n"
"随天气而改变。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:8582
msgid ""
"Heals all status problems\n"
"with a soothing scent."
msgstr ""
"释放怡人的香气，\n"
"治愈我方全员的异常状态。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:8609
msgid ""
"Feigns crying to harshly\n"
"lower the foe's Sp. Def."
msgstr ""
"假哭使对手放松警惕，\n"
"大幅降低对手的特防。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:8637
msgid ""
"Hacks with razorlike wind.\n"
"High critical-hit ratio."
msgstr ""
"用锐利的风切斩对手。\n"
"容易击中要害。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:8662 src/data/moves_info.h:9732
msgid ""
"Allows a full-power attack,\n"
"but harshly lowers Sp. Atk."
msgstr ""
"全力攻击对手。使用后\n"
"自己的特攻会大幅降低。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:8715
msgid ""
"Stops the foe from moving\n"
"with rocks and lowers Speed."
msgstr ""
"投掷岩石阻挡对手，\n"
"从而降低对手的速度。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:8742
msgid ""
"A powdery attack that may\n"
"raise all stats."
msgstr ""
"用鳞粉混入狂风攻击。\n"
"有时会提高自己全部能力。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:8775
msgid ""
"Emits a horrible screech\n"
"that harshly lowers Sp. Def."
msgstr ""
"发出摩擦金属般的噪音，\n"
"大幅降低对手的特防。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:8805
msgid ""
"Lulls the foe into sleep\n"
"with a pleasant melody."
msgstr ""
"吹出动听的草笛，\n"
"让对手陷入深深的睡眠。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:8832
msgid ""
"Makes the foe laugh to\n"
"lower Attack and Defense."
msgstr ""
"给对手挠痒痒使其发笑，\n"
"降低对手的攻击和防御。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:8862
msgid ""
"Raises Defense and Sp. Def\n"
"with a mystic power."
msgstr ""
"汲取宇宙之力，提高\n"
"自己的防御和特防。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:8893
msgid ""
"Inflicts more damage if the\n"
"user's HP is high."
msgstr ""
"自己的HP越多，\n"
"喷出的水流威力越大。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:8915
msgid ""
"A strange beam attack that\n"
"may confuse the foe."
msgstr ""
"发出神奇的光线攻击。\n"
"有时会使对手混乱。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:8941
msgid ""
"An unavoidable punch that\n"
"is thrown from shadows."
msgstr ""
"从影子中出拳攻击。\n"
"攻击必定会命中。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:8965
msgid ""
"Attacks with a peculiar\n"
"power. May cause flinching."
msgstr ""
"发出看不见的神奇力量。\n"
"有时会使对手畏缩。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:8992
msgid ""
"An uppercut thrown as if\n"
"leaping into the sky."
msgstr ""
"像要冲上天空一般，\n"
"用勾拳打向对手。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:9072
msgid ""
"Attacks with muddy water.\n"
"May lower accuracy."
msgstr ""
"向对手喷射浑浊的水。\n"
"有时会降低对手的命中率。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:9100
msgid ""
"Shoots 2 to 5 seeds in a row\n"
"to strike the foe."
msgstr ""
"向对手猛烈地发射种子，\n"
"连续攻击2～5次。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:9123
msgid ""
"An extremely speedy and\n"
"unavoidable attack."
msgstr ""
"以惊人的速度攻击对手。\n"
"攻击必定会命中。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:9147
msgid ""
"Attacks the foe by firing\n"
"2 to 5 icicles in a row."
msgstr ""
"向对手发射锋利的冰柱，\n"
"连续攻击2～5次。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:9169
msgid ""
"Hardens the body's surface\n"
"to sharply raise Defense."
msgstr ""
"使皮肤变得坚硬如铁，\n"
"大幅提高自己的防御。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:9199
msgid ""
"Blocks the foe's way to\n"
"prevent escape."
msgstr ""
"张开双手挡住去路，\n"
"使对手不能逃走。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:9261
msgid ""
"Slashes the foe with sharp\n"
"claws."
msgstr ""
"用尖锐的巨爪\n"
"劈开对手进行攻击。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:9317
msgid ""
"Bulks up the body to raise\n"
"both Attack and Defense."
msgstr ""
"使出全身力气强健肌肉，\n"
"提高自己的攻击和防御。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:9348
msgid ""
"Bounces up, then down the\n"
"next turn. May paralyze."
msgstr ""
"第1回合弹跳到高空，\n"
"第2回合攻击。可能麻痹。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:9380
msgid ""
"Hurls mud at the foe and\n"
"lowers Speed."
msgstr ""
"向对手喷射泥浆攻击，\n"
"同时降低其速度。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:9406
msgid ""
"Has a high critical-hit\n"
"ratio. May also poison."
msgstr ""
"用尾巴拍打对手。可能\n"
"中毒，容易击中要害。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:9434
msgid ""
"Cutely begs to obtain an\n"
"item held by the foe."
msgstr ""
"一边撒娇，一边\n"
"夺取对手携带的道具。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:9462
msgid ""
"A life-risking tackle that\n"
"hurts the user. May paralyze."
msgstr ""
"让电流覆盖全身猛撞，\n"
"自己受伤。可能麻痹。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:9470
msgid ""
"A life-risking tackle that\n"
"slightly hurts the user."
msgstr ""
"让电流覆盖全身猛撞对手。\n"
"自己也会受到不少伤害。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:9495
msgid ""
"Attacks with a strange leaf\n"
"that cannot be evaded."
msgstr ""
"散落神奇的叶片攻击。\n"
"攻击必定会命中。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:9548
msgid ""
"Raises Sp. Atk and Sp. Def\n"
"by focusing the mind."
msgstr ""
"静心凝神，提高\n"
"自己的特攻和特防。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:9579
msgid ""
"Slashes with a sharp leaf.\n"
"High critical-hit ratio."
msgstr ""
"挥舞叶片劈开对手。\n"
"容易击中要害。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:9604
msgid ""
"A mystical dance that\n"
"raises Attack and Speed."
msgstr ""
"激烈地跳起神秘的舞蹈，\n"
"提高自己的攻击和速度。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:9636
msgid ""
"Hurls boulders at the foe\n"
"2 to 5 times in a row."
msgstr ""
"向对手投掷坚硬的岩石，\n"
"连续攻击2～5次。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:9659
msgid ""
"A fast and unavoidable\n"
"electric attack."
msgstr ""
"向对手发出电击攻击。\n"
"攻击必定会命中。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:9681
msgid ""
"Attacks with ultrasonic\n"
"waves. May confuse the foe."
msgstr ""
"用水的振动攻击对手。\n"
"有时会使对手混乱。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:9708
msgid ""
"Summons strong light to\n"
"attack 2 turns later."
msgstr ""
"汇聚强光，\n"
"2回合后攻击对手。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:9759
msgid ""
"Restores the user's HP by\n"
"half of its max HP."
msgstr ""
"降落到地面使身体休息，\n"
"回复最大HP的一半。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:9785
msgid ""
"Gravity is intensified\n"
"negating levitation."
msgstr ""
"5回合内增强重力，\n"
"使漂浮效果无效。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:9810
msgid ""
"Negates evasion and the\n"
"Dark type's immunities."
msgstr ""
"使对手的闪避率无效，\n"
"恶属性也能被超能力击中。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:9834
msgid ""
"Powerful against a sleeping\n"
"foe, but also wakes it."
msgstr ""
"对睡眠的对手威力翻倍，\n"
"但对手会醒过来。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:9860 src/data/moves_info.h:16782
msgid ""
"Swings with a heavy fist.\n"
"Lowers the user's Speed."
msgstr ""
"挥舞强力而沉重的拳头。\n"
"自己的速度会降低。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:9888
msgid ""
"A high-speed spin that does\n"
"more damage to faster a foe."
msgstr ""
"高速旋转撞击。对手比\n"
"自己越快，威力越大。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:9911
msgid ""
"Faints to restore the HP and\n"
"status of the next Pokémon."
msgstr ""
"自己陷入濒死，治愈下个\n"
"出场宝可梦的HP和状态。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:9936
msgid ""
"Does double damage to a foe\n"
"with half HP or less."
msgstr ""
"对手的HP在一半以下时，\n"
"招式的威力会翻倍。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:9957
msgid ""
"The effectiveness varies\n"
"with the held Berry."
msgstr ""
"从树果获得力量攻击。\n"
"属性和威力随树果改变。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:9978
msgid ""
"Hits a protecting foe\n"
"and lifts those effects."
msgstr ""
"攻击正在守住的对手，\n"
"并解除守住的效果。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:10008 src/data/moves_info.h:12166
msgid ""
"Eats the foe's held Berry\n"
"and gains its effect."
msgstr ""
"咬对手，吃掉对手携带的\n"
"树果并获得其效果。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:10063
msgid ""
"The user sharply raises\n"
"one of its stats."
msgstr ""
"通过点穴，\n"
"大幅提高某一项能力。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:10088 src/data/moves_info.h:21490
msgid ""
"Retaliates against the foe\n"
"that last damaged the user."
msgstr ""
"对最后一次给予自己伤害\n"
"的对手加倍奉还。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:10115 src/data/moves_info.h:13972 src/data/moves_info.h:19629
msgid ""
"Attacks and rushes back to\n"
"switch with a party Pokémon."
msgstr ""
"攻击之后急速返回，\n"
"和替补宝可梦替换。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:10137
msgid ""
"Fights up close. This lowers\n"
"the user's defensive stats."
msgstr ""
"不顾防守地近身战斗。\n"
"自己的防御和特防会降低。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:10165
msgid ""
"An attack that gains power\n"
"if the user moves last."
msgstr ""
"比对手后行动时，\n"
"威力会翻倍。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:10187
msgid ""
"An attack that gains power\n"
"if the foe has been hurt."
msgstr ""
"对手在该回合已受到伤害\n"
"的话，威力会翻倍。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:10209
msgid ""
"Prevents the foe from\n"
"using any items."
msgstr ""
"5回合内对手\n"
"不能使用携带的道具。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:10232
msgid ""
"The effectiveness varies\n"
"with the held item."
msgstr ""
"投掷携带的道具攻击。\n"
"效果随道具而改变。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:10262
msgid ""
"Transfers status problems\n"
"to the foe."
msgstr ""
"将自己的异常状态\n"
"转移给对手。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:10284
msgid ""
"The less PP the move has\n"
"the more damage it does."
msgstr ""
"招式的剩余PP越少，\n"
"威力就越大。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:10306
msgid ""
"Prevents the foes from\n"
"recovering HP for 5 turns."
msgstr ""
"5回合内对手无法使用\n"
"招式或特性回复HP。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:10329 src/data/moves_info.h:12465 src/data/moves_info.h:21955
msgid ""
"The more HP the foe has,\n"
"the greater the power."
msgstr ""
"对手的HP越多，\n"
"威力就越大。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:10351 src/data/moves_info.h:20051
msgid ""
"The user swaps its Attack\n"
"and Defense stats."
msgstr ""
"利用超能力，\n"
"交换自己的攻击和防御。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:10376
msgid ""
"Stomach acid suppresses\n"
"the foe's Ability."
msgstr ""
"在对手身上吐出胃液，\n"
"使对手的特性无效。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:10399
msgid ""
"Prevents the foe from\n"
"landing critical hits."
msgstr ""
"5回合内向上天祈祷，\n"
"从而不会被对手击中要害。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:10424
msgid ""
"Executes the foe's attack\n"
"with greater power."
msgstr ""
"抢先夺取对手的招式，\n"
"提高威力使出。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:10456
msgid ""
"The user mimics the last\n"
"move used by a foe."
msgstr ""
"模仿对手刚刚使用的招式，\n"
"自己也使用相同招式。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:10487
msgid ""
"Swaps changes to Attack\n"
"and Sp. Atk with the foe."
msgstr ""
"与对手互换攻击和特攻\n"
"的能力变化。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:10510
msgid ""
"Swaps changes to Defense\n"
"and Sp. Def with the foe."
msgstr ""
"与对手互换防御和特防\n"
"的能力变化。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:10533
msgid ""
"Does more damage the more\n"
"the foe has powered up."
msgstr ""
"对手的能力提高得越多，\n"
"攻击的威力就越大。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:10555
msgid ""
"Can only be used if every\n"
"other move has been used."
msgstr ""
"学会的其他招式全部\n"
"使用过后才能使出。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:10577
msgid ""
"Plants a seed on the foe\n"
"giving it Insomnia."
msgstr ""
"种下让对手烦恼的种子，\n"
"使其特性变为不眠。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:10601 src/data/moves_info.h:21896
msgid ""
"Attacks first if the foe\n"
"is readying an attack."
msgstr ""
"在对手准备攻击时\n"
"抢先攻击。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:10623
msgid ""
"Sets spikes that poison a\n"
"foe switching in."
msgstr ""
"撒下毒菱，让替换出场的\n"
"对手中毒。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:10650
msgid ""
"Swaps any stat changes\n"
"with the foe."
msgstr ""
"利用超能力，\n"
"互换自己和对手的能力变化。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:10673
msgid ""
"Forms a veil of water\n"
"that restores HP."
msgstr ""
"用水环包围自己，\n"
"每回合回复少许HP。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:10698
msgid ""
"The user levitates with\n"
"electromagnetism."
msgstr ""
"用电产生的磁力浮在空中。\n"
"5回合内可以飘浮。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:10724
msgid ""
"A charge that may burn the\n"
"foe. Also hurts the user."
msgstr ""
"让火焰覆盖全身猛撞。可能\n"
"灼伤，自己也会受伤。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:10752
msgid ""
"A shock wave attack that\n"
"may paralyze the foe."
msgstr ""
"向对手的腹部发送冲击波。\n"
"有时会让对手麻痹。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:10778
msgid ""
"Attacks with an aura blast\n"
"that cannot be evaded."
msgstr ""
"从体内放出波导之力。\n"
"攻击必定会命中。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:10801
msgid ""
"Polishes the body to\n"
"sharply raise Speed."
msgstr ""
"打磨自己的身体，\n"
"大幅提高自己的速度。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:10830
msgid ""
"A stabbing attack that\n"
"may poison the foe."
msgstr ""
"用毒刺刺穿对手。\n"
"有时会让对手中毒。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:10856
msgid ""
"Attacks with a horrible\n"
"aura. May cause flinching."
msgstr ""
"放出充满恶意的恐怖气场。\n"
"有时会使对手畏缩。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:10882
msgid ""
"Hits as soon as possible.\n"
"High critical-hit ratio."
msgstr ""
"抓住空隙劈开对手。\n"
"容易击中要害。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:10906
msgid ""
"The user swings its tail\n"
"like a wave to attack."
msgstr ""
"如狂澜般挥舞大尾巴\n"
"攻击对手。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:10928
msgid ""
"A barrage of hard seeds\n"
"is fired at the foe."
msgstr ""
"用硬壳种子\n"
"从上方猛烈砸向对手。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:10950
msgid ""
"Attacks with a blade of\n"
"air. May cause flinching."
msgstr ""
"用连天空也能劈开的空气\n"
"之刃攻击。可能使对手畏缩。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:10976
msgid ""
"Slashes the foe with crossed\n"
"scythes, claws, etc."
msgstr ""
"将镰刀或爪子等交叉成\n"
"剪刀状，劈开对手。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:10999
msgid ""
"A damaging sound wave that\n"
"may lower Sp. Def."
msgstr ""
"利用振动发出音波攻击。\n"
"有时会降低对手的特防。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:11027
msgid ""
"Generates a shock wave to\n"
"damage the foe."
msgstr ""
"从大大的口中掀起冲击波\n"
"攻击对手。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:11049
msgid ""
"Tackles the foe with menace.\n"
"May cause flinching."
msgstr ""
"释放恐怖的杀气撞击对手。\n"
"有时会使对手畏缩。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:11076
msgid ""
"Attacks with rays of light\n"
"that sparkle like diamonds."
msgstr ""
"发射如宝石般闪耀的\n"
"光芒攻击对手。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:11097
msgid ""
"A punch that drains\n"
"half the damage inflicted."
msgstr ""
"用拳头吸取对手的力量。\n"
"回复伤害一半的HP。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:11125
msgid ""
"Whirls its fists to send\n"
"a wave that strikes first."
msgstr ""
"挥动拳头掀起真空波。\n"
"必定能够先制攻击。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:11146
msgid ""
"Attacks at full power.\n"
"May lower Sp. Def."
msgstr ""
"提高气势，释放全部力量。\n"
"有时会降低对手的特防。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:11173
msgid ""
"Draws power from nature to\n"
"attack. May lower Sp. Def."
msgstr ""
"汲取自然之力攻击对手。\n"
"有时会降低对手的特防。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:11200
msgid ""
"A low altitude charge that\n"
"also hurts the user."
msgstr ""
"收拢翅膀低空飞行突击。\n"
"自己也会受到不少伤害。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:11223
msgid ""
"Makes the ground erupt with\n"
"power. May lower Sp. Def."
msgstr ""
"使对手脚下的地面喷发。\n"
"有时会降低对手的特防。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:11250
msgid ""
"Swaps items with the foe\n"
"faster than the eye can see."
msgstr ""
"用快到看不见的速度\n"
"交换自己和对手的道具。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:11306
msgid ""
"Thinks bad thoughts to\n"
"sharply raise Sp. Atk."
msgstr ""
"谋划坏事，\n"
"大幅提高自己的特攻。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:11335
msgid ""
"Punches as fast as a bul-\n"
"let. It always hits first."
msgstr ""
"快速挥出如子弹般坚硬的\n"
"拳头。必定能够先制攻击。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:11380
msgid ""
"Hurls a chunk of ice that\n"
"always strikes first."
msgstr ""
"瞬间制作冰块投掷对手。\n"
"必定能够先制攻击。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:11401
msgid ""
"Strikes with a shadow claw.\n"
"High critical-hit ratio."
msgstr ""
"用影子做成的利爪劈开\n"
"对手。容易击中要害。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:11425
msgid ""
"May cause flinching or\n"
"leave the foe paralyzed."
msgstr ""
"用带电的牙齿咬对手。\n"
"可能使对手畏缩或麻痹。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:11491
msgid ""
"May cause flinching or\n"
"leave the foe with a burn."
msgstr ""
"用带火的牙齿咬对手。\n"
"可能使对手畏缩或灼伤。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:11522
msgid ""
"Extends the user's shadow\n"
"to strike first."
msgstr ""
"伸长影子，\n"
"从背后先制攻击对手。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:11544
msgid ""
"Throws a blob of mud to\n"
"damage and cut accuracy."
msgstr ""
"发射坚硬的泥弹攻击。\n"
"有时会降低对手的命中率。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:11571
msgid ""
"Tears with psychic blades.\n"
"High critical-hit ratio."
msgstr ""
"用实体化的心之利刃劈开\n"
"对手。容易击中要害。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:11594
msgid ""
"Hits with a strong head-\n"
"butt. May cause flinching."
msgstr ""
"集中精神用头槌攻击。\n"
"有时会使对手畏缩。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:11620
msgid ""
"Emits a flash of energy to\n"
"damage and cut accuracy."
msgstr ""
"发射被磨亮的身体发出的\n"
"光芒。可能降低命中率。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:11646
msgid ""
"Releases a blast of light\n"
"that may lower Sp. Def."
msgstr ""
"汇集光之能量发射出去。\n"
"有时会降低对手的特防。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:11672
msgid ""
"A charging attack that may\n"
"confuse the foe."
msgstr ""
"发动猛撞攻击对手。\n"
"有时会使对手混乱。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:11698
msgid ""
"Removes obstacles and\n"
"lowers evasion."
msgstr ""
"吹散撒菱等障碍物，\n"
"并降低对手的闪避率。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:11726
msgid ""
"Slower Pokémon get to move\n"
"first for 5 turns."
msgstr ""
"制造出离奇的空间。5回合\n"
"内速度慢的宝可梦先行动。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:11749
msgid ""
"Summons comets from the sky,\n"
"but harshly lowers Sp. Atk."
msgstr ""
"从天空中召唤彗星。使用后\n"
"自己的特攻会大幅降低。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:11775
msgid ""
"Zaps all others with\n"
"electricity. May paralyze."
msgstr ""
"用耀眼的电击攻击周围\n"
"所有宝可梦。可能麻痹。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:11800 src/data/moves_info.h:14573
msgid ""
"Torches all others with\n"
"scarlet flames. May burn."
msgstr ""
"用火焰攻击周围所有\n"
"宝可梦。有时会灼伤。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:11825
msgid ""
"Whips up a storm of leaves,\n"
"but harshly lowers Sp. Atk."
msgstr ""
"掀起尖叶风暴攻击。使用后\n"
"自己的特攻会大幅降低。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:11851
msgid ""
"Violently lashes the foe\n"
"with vines or tentacles."
msgstr ""
"将藤蔓或触手挥舞起来，\n"
"抽打对手进行攻击。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:11904
msgid ""
"A slash that may poison a\n"
"foe and do critical damage."
msgstr ""
"用毒刃劈开对手。可能\n"
"中毒，容易击中要害。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:11932
msgid ""
"Shoots filthy garbage at\n"
"the foe. May also poison."
msgstr ""
"用垃圾射击对手攻击。\n"
"有时会让对手中毒。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:11957
msgid ""
"Slams the foe with a hard\n"
"head. May cause flinching."
msgstr ""
"用钢铁般坚硬的头部撞击。\n"
"有时会使对手畏缩。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:11983
msgid ""
"Launches a magnet that\n"
"strikes without fail."
msgstr ""
"发射吸附在对手身上的\n"
"钢铁炸弹。攻击必定会命中。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:12005
msgid ""
"Stabs the foe with stones.\n"
"High critical-hit ratio."
msgstr ""
"用尖尖的岩石刺向对手。\n"
"容易击中要害。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:12027
msgid ""
"Makes the opposite gender\n"
"harshly lower its Sp. Atk."
msgstr ""
"诱惑异性，\n"
"大幅降低对手的特攻。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:12054
msgid ""
"Sets floating stones that\n"
"hurt a foe switching in."
msgstr ""
"在对手周围散布浮游的\n"
"岩石，伤害替换出场的对手。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:12080
msgid ""
"A snare attack that does\n"
"more damage to a heavier foe."
msgstr ""
"用草缠住并绊倒对手。\n"
"对手越重，威力越大。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:12103
msgid ""
"Attacks with a sound wave\n"
"that causes confusion."
msgstr ""
"用叽叽喳喳的音波\n"
"攻击对手。会让对手混乱。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:12144
msgid ""
"The type varies with the\n"
"kind of Plate held."
msgstr ""
"放出无数光弹。\n"
"属性随石板而改变。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:12191
msgid ""
"Fires a beam of electricity.\n"
"May raise Sp. Atk."
msgstr ""
"向对手发射电流。\n"
"有时会提高自己的特攻。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:12218
msgid ""
"Slams the body into a foe.\n"
"The user gets hurt too."
msgstr ""
"用坚硬的躯体撞击对手。\n"
"自己也会受到不少伤害。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:12241
msgid ""
"Strikes first by dashing\n"
"at the foe at a high speed."
msgstr ""
"以迅雷不及掩耳之势\n"
"扑向对手。必定能够先制。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:12263
msgid ""
"Underlings pummel the foe.\n"
"High critical-hit ratio."
msgstr ""
"召唤手下攻击对手。\n"
"容易击中要害。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:12285
msgid ""
"Raises Defense and Sp. Def\n"
"with a living shield."
msgstr ""
"手下聚集成防御之盾，\n"
"提高自己的防御和特防。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:12315
msgid ""
"The user's underlings heal\n"
"up to half of its max HP."
msgstr ""
"召唤手下疗伤，\n"
"回复自己最大HP的一半。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:12341
msgid ""
"A life-risking headbutt that\n"
"seriously hurts the user."
msgstr ""
"拼命地用头撞向对手。\n"
"自己也会受到非常大的伤害。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:12364
msgid ""
"Slams the foe with a tail\n"
"etc. Strikes twice."
msgstr ""
"使用尾巴等击打对手，\n"
"连续2次给予伤害。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:12417
msgid ""
"Tears the foe, and space.\n"
"High critical-hit ratio."
msgstr ""
"将对手连同周围的空间\n"
"一同撕裂。容易击中要害。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:12439
msgid ""
"Faints to heal the HP, PP, and\n"
"status of the next Pokémon."
msgstr ""
"自己陷入濒死，治愈下个出\n"
"场宝可梦的HP、PP和状态。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:12512
msgid ""
"Drags the foes into total\n"
"darkness, inducing Sleep."
msgstr ""
"将对手拖入黑暗的世界，\n"
"从而让对手陷入睡眠。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:12537
msgid ""
"Generates a shock wave that\n"
"harshly lowers Sp. Def."
msgstr ""
"产生冲击波攻击对手。\n"
"有时会大幅降低对手特防。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:12563
msgid ""
"A repulsive attack that may\n"
"raise all stats."
msgstr ""
"吹起令人毛骨悚然的风。\n"
"有时会提高自己全部能力。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:12595 src/data/moves_info.h:15134
msgid ""
"Vanishes, then strikes next\n"
"turn. Ignores protection."
msgstr ""
"第1回合消失，第2回合攻击。\n"
"无视守住招式。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:12627
msgid ""
"Sharpens its claws to raise\n"
"Attack and Accuracy."
msgstr ""
"将爪子磨得锋利，提高\n"
"自己的攻击和命中率。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:12657
msgid ""
"Evades wide-ranging attacks\n"
"for one turn."
msgstr ""
"在1回合内防住击中\n"
"我方全员的攻击。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:12684
msgid ""
"Averages changes to Defense\n"
"and Sp. Def with the foe."
msgstr ""
"利用超能力，与对手平分\n"
"防御和特防。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:12707
msgid ""
"Averages changes to Attack\n"
"and Sp. Atk with the foe."
msgstr ""
"利用超能力，与对手平分\n"
"攻击和特攻。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:12730
msgid ""
"Defense and Sp. Def stats\n"
"are swapped for 5 turns."
msgstr ""
"制造出离奇的空间。5回合\n"
"内互换防御和特防。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:12753 src/data/moves_info.h:14453
msgid ""
"An odd psychic wave that\n"
"deals physical damage."
msgstr ""
"将神奇的念波实体化攻击，\n"
"给予物理伤害。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:12774
msgid ""
"Does double damage if the\n"
"foe is poisoned."
msgstr ""
"对手处于中毒状态时，\n"
"威力会翻倍。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:12796
msgid ""
"Sheds additional weight to\n"
"sharply raise Speed."
msgstr ""
"舍弃身体上不必要的部分，\n"
"大幅提高自己的速度。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:12825
msgid ""
"Scatters powder to make\n"
"foes attack only the user."
msgstr ""
"撒出愤怒之粉，\n"
"使对手只攻击自己。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:12853
msgid ""
"Makes the foe float. It is\n"
"easier to hit for 3 turns."
msgstr ""
"使对手浮在空中，\n"
"3回合内更容易被击中。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:12877
msgid ""
"Held items lose their\n"
"effects for 5 turns."
msgstr ""
"制造出离奇的空间。5回合\n"
"内携带的道具失去效果。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:12900
msgid ""
"Throws a rock to knock the\n"
"foe down to the ground."
msgstr ""
"扔石头击落对手，\n"
"使飞行的对手落到地面。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:12923
msgid ""
"This fierce blow always\n"
"lands a critical hit."
msgstr ""
"向对手使出强烈的一击。\n"
"必定会击中要害。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:12946
msgid ""
"A bursting flame that does\n"
"damage to all foes."
msgstr ""
"用爆裂的火焰攻击对手，\n"
"火星也会波及周围的对手。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:12970
msgid ""
"Swamps all others with a wave\n"
"of sludge. May also poison."
msgstr ""
"用污泥波攻击周围所有\n"
"宝可梦。有时会让其中毒。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:12995
msgid ""
"Dances to raise Sp. Atk\n"
"Sp. Def and Speed."
msgstr ""
"轻巧地跳起神秘的舞蹈，\n"
"提高特攻、特防和速度。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:13027 src/data/moves_info.h:14322
msgid ""
"Greater power the more the\n"
"user outweighs the foe."
msgstr ""
"自己比对手越重，\n"
"威力越大。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:13051
msgid ""
"A shock wave that hurts all\n"
"Pokémon of the user's type."
msgstr ""
"用神奇电波攻击所有与\n"
"自己属性相同的宝可梦。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:13072
msgid ""
"Hurls an orb that does more\n"
"damage to a slower foe."
msgstr ""
"发射电气团攻击。对手比\n"
"自己越慢，威力越大。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:13094
msgid ""
"Sprays water at the foe,\n"
"changing it to a Water-type."
msgstr ""
"泼洒大量的水，\n"
"使对手变成水属性。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:13118
msgid ""
"Attacks in a cloak of\n"
"flames. Raises Speed."
msgstr ""
"让火焰覆盖全身攻击对手。\n"
"同时提高自己的速度。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:13146
msgid ""
"Coils up to raise Attack,\n"
"Defense and Accuracy."
msgstr ""
"盘起身体集中精神，提高\n"
"攻击、防御和命中率。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:13177
msgid ""
"Attacks the foe's legs\n"
"lowering its Speed."
msgstr ""
"快速攻击对手的脚，\n"
"从而降低对手的速度。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:13204
msgid ""
"Sprays a hide-melting acid.\n"
"Harshly lowers Sp. Def."
msgstr ""
"喷出能溶化对手的液体，\n"
"大幅降低对手的特防。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:13231
msgid ""
"The higher the foe's Attack\n"
"the more damage caused."
msgstr ""
"利用对手的力量攻击。\n"
"对手攻击越高，伤害越大。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:13253
msgid ""
"A beam that changes the\n"
"foe's Ability to Simple."
msgstr ""
"向对手发送谜之念波，\n"
"使其特性变为单纯。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:13277
msgid ""
"Makes the foe mimic the\n"
"user, gaining its Ability."
msgstr ""
"用神奇的节奏跳舞，使对手\n"
"的特性变得和自己相同。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:13300
msgid ""
"Helps out the target, letting\n"
"it move next."
msgstr ""
"支援对手，\n"
"让对手紧接着自己行动。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:13326
msgid ""
"A song that inflicts damage.\n"
"Others can join in too."
msgstr ""
"用歌声攻击对手。\n"
"大家一起轮唱时威力提高。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:13352
msgid ""
"Does more damage every turn\n"
"it is used."
msgstr ""
"用回声攻击对手。\n"
"每回合连续使用威力提高。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:13375 src/data/moves_info.h:14270
msgid ""
"The foe's stat changes don't\n"
"affect this attack's damage."
msgstr ""
"无视对手的能力变化，\n"
"直接给予伤害。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:13398
msgid ""
"Attacks with white haze that\n"
"eliminates all stat changes."
msgstr ""
"投掷特殊的泥块攻击，\n"
"使对手的能力复原。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:13422 src/data/moves_info.h:17197
msgid ""
"Greater power the more the\n"
"user's stats are raised."
msgstr ""
"自己的能力提高得越多，\n"
"威力就越大。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:13443
msgid ""
"Evades priority attacks\n"
"for one turn."
msgstr ""
"在1回合内\n"
"防住对手的先制攻击。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:13470
msgid ""
"The user switches places\n"
"with its partner."
msgstr ""
"用神奇的力量瞬间移动，\n"
"互换自己和同伴的位置。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:13494
msgid ""
"Shoots boiling water at the\n"
"foe. May inflict a burn."
msgstr ""
"向对手喷射滚烫的热水。\n"
"有时会让对手灼伤。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:13520
msgid ""
"Sharply raises offenses and\n"
"Speed, but lowers defenses."
msgstr ""
"打破外壳，大幅提高攻击、\n"
"特攻和速度，降低防御。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:13556
msgid ""
"Restores the target by up\n"
"to half their max HP."
msgstr ""
"放出治愈波动，\n"
"回复对手最大HP的一半。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:13582
msgid ""
"Does double damage if the\n"
"foe has a status problem."
msgstr ""
"接二连三地攻击。对手处于\n"
"异常状态时威力翻倍。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:13605
msgid ""
"Takes the foe into the sky\n"
"then drops it the next turn."
msgstr ""
"第1回合将对手带到空中，\n"
"第2回合将其摔落。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:13632
msgid ""
"Rotates its gears to raise\n"
"Attack and Speed."
msgstr ""
"转动齿轮，提高\n"
"自己的攻击，大幅提高速度。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:13662
msgid ""
"The foe is thrown to switch\n"
"it out or end wild battles."
msgstr ""
"扔飞对手，强制换人。\n"
"野生宝可梦则战斗结束。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:13714
msgid ""
"Suppresses the foe, making\n"
"it move last."
msgstr ""
"压制对手，\n"
"让其行动顺序变为最后。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:13737
msgid ""
"Does double damage if the\n"
"user has no item."
msgstr ""
"自己没有携带道具时，\n"
"威力会翻倍。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:13759
msgid ""
"The user reflects the foe's\n"
"type, copying it."
msgstr ""
"反射对手的属性，\n"
"让自己也变成相同的属性。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:13783
msgid ""
"An attack that does more\n"
"damage if an ally fainted."
msgstr ""
"为倒下的同伴报仇。上回合\n"
"有同伴濒死时威力提高。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:13805
msgid ""
"The user faints to damage\n"
"the foe equal to its HP."
msgstr ""
"拼命攻击对手，给予等同\n"
"自己HP的伤害后濒死。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:13829
msgid ""
"The user gives its held\n"
"item to the foe."
msgstr ""
"将自己携带的道具\n"
"交给对手。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:13856
msgid ""
"Powerful and sure to inflict\n"
"a burn, but inaccurate."
msgstr ""
"用烈火包裹对手攻击，\n"
"必定灼伤，但命中率低。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:13881
msgid ""
"Attacks with a column of\n"
"water. May make a rainbow."
msgstr ""
"用水柱攻击。与火组合时\n"
"会出现彩虹。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:13912
msgid ""
"Attacks with a column of\n"
"fire. May burn the grass."
msgstr ""
"用火柱攻击。与草组合时\n"
"会形成火海。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:13942
msgid ""
"Attacks with a column of\n"
"grass. May create a swamp."
msgstr ""
"用草柱攻击。与水组合时\n"
"会形成湿地。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:13993
msgid ""
"Resisting, the user attacks\n"
"the foes. Lowers Sp. Atk."
msgstr ""
"抵抗着攻击对手。\n"
"降低对手的特攻。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:14019
msgid ""
"Stomps down on the ground.\n"
"Hits all and lowers Speed."
msgstr ""
"用力踩踏地面攻击周围所有\n"
"宝可梦，并降低其速度。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:14046
msgid ""
"This cold breath always\n"
"lands a critical hit."
msgstr ""
"将冰冷的气息吹向对手。\n"
"必定会击中要害。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:14068
msgid ""
"Knocks away foe to switch\n"
"it out or end wild battles."
msgstr ""
"弹飞对手，强制换人。\n"
"野生宝可梦则战斗结束。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:14092
msgid ""
"The user is roused.\n"
"Ups Attack and Sp. Atk."
msgstr ""
"激励自己，\n"
"提高攻击和特攻。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:14122
msgid ""
"Snares the foes with an\n"
"electric net. Lowers Speed."
msgstr ""
"用电网捉住对手攻击，\n"
"从而降低对手的速度。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:14148
msgid ""
"An electrical tackle that\n"
"also hurts the user."
msgstr ""
"让电流覆盖全身撞向对手。\n"
"自己也会受到少许伤害。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:14171
msgid ""
"Spins its body like a drill.\n"
"High critical-hit ratio."
msgstr ""
"像钻头一样旋转身体撞击。\n"
"容易击中要害。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:14194
msgid ""
"Attacks with brutal hits\n"
"that strike twice."
msgstr ""
"用身体坚硬的部分殴打\n"
"对手。连续2次给予伤害。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:14217
msgid ""
"A sudden blow after a cute\n"
"act. May cause flinching."
msgstr ""
"装可爱后使出猛烈一击。\n"
"有时会使对手畏缩。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:14243
msgid ""
"Uses horns to drain\n"
"half the damage inflicted."
msgstr ""
"将角刺入对手吸取养分。\n"
"回复伤害一半的HP。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:14294
msgid ""
"Tears at the foe with sharp\n"
"shells. May lower Defense."
msgstr ""
"用锋利的贝壳切斩对手。\n"
"有时会降低对手的防御。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:14345
msgid ""
"Circles the foe with leaves\n"
"to damage and cut accuracy."
msgstr ""
"用叶片包裹住对手攻击。\n"
"有时会降低对手的命中率。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:14371
msgid ""
"Crushes the foe with its\n"
"body. May cause flinching."
msgstr ""
"旋转揉成团的身体压扁对手。\n"
"有时会使对手畏缩。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:14398
msgid ""
"Wraps its body in cotton.\n"
"Drastically raises Defense."
msgstr ""
"用软绵绵的棉花包裹身体，\n"
"巨幅提高自己的防御。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:14427
msgid ""
"Looses a pitch-black shock\n"
"wave. May lower accuracy."
msgstr ""
"放出漆黑的冲击波攻击。\n"
"有时会降低对手的命中率。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:14474
msgid ""
"Strikes the foe with its\n"
"tail 2 to 5 times."
msgstr ""
"用坚硬的尾巴击打对手，\n"
"连续攻击2～5次。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:14497
msgid ""
"Traps the foe in a fierce\n"
"wind. May cause confusion."
msgstr ""
"用强烈的风暴包围对手。\n"
"有时会使对手混乱。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:14526
msgid ""
"A charge using guard hair.\n"
"It hurts the user a little."
msgstr ""
"用厚重的毛发撞向对手。\n"
"自己也会受到少许伤害。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:14549
msgid ""
"Throws two steel gears\n"
"that strike twice."
msgstr ""
"向对手投掷钢铁齿轮，\n"
"连续2次给予伤害。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:14599
msgid ""
"The type varies with the\n"
"kind of Drive held."
msgstr ""
"发射光弹攻击。\n"
"属性随卡带而改变。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:14622
msgid ""
"Attacks with an ancient\n"
"song. May induce sleep."
msgstr ""
"让对手听古老之歌攻击。\n"
"有时会让对手陷入睡眠。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:14651
msgid ""
"Cuts with a long horn that\n"
"does physical damage."
msgstr ""
"用长角切斩对手，\n"
"给予物理伤害。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:14674
msgid ""
"Blows very cold air at the\n"
"foes. It lowers their Speed."
msgstr ""
"将冰冷的冷气吹向对手，\n"
"从而降低对手的速度。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:14700
msgid ""
"Strikes with a great amount\n"
"of lightning. May paralyze."
msgstr ""
"让强大的电流覆盖全身撞击。\n"
"有时会让对手麻痹。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:14726
msgid ""
"Engulfs the foe in a blue\n"
"flame. May inflict a burn."
msgstr ""
"用美丽而激烈的青焰包裹\n"
"对手攻击。有时会灼伤。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:14751
msgid ""
"Dances cloaked in flames.\n"
"May raise Sp. Atk."
msgstr ""
"让火焰覆盖全身振翅起舞。\n"
"有时会提高自己的特攻。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:14779
msgid ""
"A powerful 2-turn move that\n"
"may paralyze the foe."
msgstr ""
"用冰包裹身体，第2回合\n"
"撞向对手。可能让对手麻痹。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:14808
msgid ""
"A powerful 2-turn move that\n"
"may inflict a burn."
msgstr ""
"用冷气包裹对手，第2回合\n"
"攻击。有时会让对手灼伤。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:14837
msgid ""
"Yells and rants at the foe\n"
"lowering its Sp. Atk."
msgstr ""
"叫嚷着絮絮叨叨，\n"
"降低对手的特攻。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:14866
msgid ""
"Drops large icicles on the\n"
"foe. May cause flinching."
msgstr ""
"将大冰柱砸向对手攻击。\n"
"有时会使对手畏缩。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:14891
msgid ""
"Very powerful, but lowers\n"
"Defense, Sp. Def and Speed."
msgstr ""
"威力非常强大，但会降低\n"
"自己的防御、特防和速度。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:14922
msgid ""
"Summons a fireball. Works\n"
"well with a thunderbolt."
msgstr ""
"释放出巨大的火焰。\n"
"与雷击组合时威力提高。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:14944
msgid ""
"Summons a thunderbolt.\n"
"Works well with a fireball."
msgstr ""
"释放出巨大的雷击。\n"
"与火焰组合时威力提高。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:14965
msgid ""
"This attack does Fighting-\n"
"and Flying-type damage."
msgstr ""
"同时具有格斗属性和\n"
"飞行属性的攻击。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:14992
msgid ""
"Evades damaging moves.\n"
"Only works on 1st turn."
msgstr ""
"掀起榻榻米挡下攻击招式。\n"
"只能在出场第1回合使用。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:15022
msgid ""
"Lets out a loud belch.\n"
"Must eat a Berry to use it."
msgstr ""
"朝着对手打饱嗝。\n"
"必须吃了树果才能使用。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:15051
msgid ""
"Ups the Attack and Sp. Atk\n"
"of Grass-type Pokémon."
msgstr ""
"翻耕土地，提高\n"
"草属性宝可梦的攻击和特攻。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:15082
msgid ""
"Weaves a sticky net that\n"
"slows foes switching in."
msgstr ""
"在周围布下黏黏网，降低\n"
"替换出场的对手的速度。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:15166
msgid ""
"Goes trick-or-treating,\n"
"adding Ghost type to foe."
msgstr ""
"邀请对手参加万圣夜，\n"
"使对手追加幽灵属性。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:15190
msgid ""
"Intimidates the foe, to cut\n"
"Attack and Sp. Atk."
msgstr ""
"发出挑战的吼叫，\n"
"降低对手的攻击和特攻。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:15220
msgid ""
"Electrifies Normal-type\n"
"moves with charged atoms."
msgstr ""
"将电离子撒满场地，\n"
"使一般属性招式变为电属性。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:15244
msgid ""
"Damages all others and\n"
"restores by half of it."
msgstr ""
"用电攻击周围所有宝可梦，\n"
"回复伤害一半的HP。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:15270
msgid ""
"Puts a curse on the foe,\n"
"adding the Grass type."
msgstr ""
"向对手施加森林咒语，\n"
"使对手追加草属性。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:15294
msgid ""
"Stirs up a violent storm\n"
"of petals to attack all."
msgstr ""
"猛烈地刮起飞雪般的\n"
"花瓣，攻击周围所有宝可梦。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:15325
msgid ""
"Super effective on Water-\n"
"types."
msgstr ""
"急速冷冻对手。\n"
"对水属性也效果绝佳。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:15354
msgid ""
"Lets out a charming cry\n"
"that cannot be evaded."
msgstr ""
"发出魅惑的叫声攻击对手。\n"
"攻击必定会命中。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:15377
msgid ""
"Lowers the foe's Attack and\n"
"Sp. Atk, then switches out."
msgstr ""
"降低对手的攻击和特攻后，\n"
"和替补宝可梦替换。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:15407
msgid ""
"Swaps all stat changes that\n"
"affect the target."
msgstr ""
"使对手的所有能力变化\n"
"颠倒过来。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:15430
msgid ""
"A kiss that steals over\n"
"half the damage inflicted."
msgstr ""
"用亲吻吸取对手的HP。\n"
"回复伤害75%的HP。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:15457
msgid ""
"Evades status moves for\n"
"one turn."
msgstr ""
"使用神奇的力量，\n"
"在1回合内防住变化招式。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:15483
msgid ""
"Raises the Defense of\n"
"Grass-type Pokémon."
msgstr ""
"使用神奇的力量，\n"
"提高草属性宝可梦的防御。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:15512
msgid ""
"The ground turns to grass\n"
"for 5 turns. Restores HP."
msgstr ""
"5回合内变成青草场地，\n"
"每回合回复地面上宝可梦的HP。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:15538
msgid ""
"Covers the ground with mist\n"
"for 5 turns. Blocks status."
msgstr ""
"5回合内变成薄雾场地，\n"
"地面上宝可梦不会异常状态。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:15564
msgid ""
"Electrifies the foe, making\n"
"its next move Electric-type."
msgstr ""
"使对手在该回合使用的\n"
"招式变为电属性。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:15586
msgid ""
"Plays rough with the foe.\n"
"May lower Attack."
msgstr ""
"与对手嬉闹般地攻击。\n"
"有时会降低对手的攻击。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:15613
msgid ""
"Stirs up a fairy wind to\n"
"strike the foe."
msgstr ""
"刮起妖精之风，\n"
"吹向对手进行攻击。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:15635
msgid ""
"Attacks with the power of\n"
"the moon. May lower Sp. Atk."
msgstr ""
"借用月亮的力量攻击对手。\n"
"有时会降低对手的特攻。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:15661
msgid ""
"Attacks everything with a\n"
"destructive sound wave."
msgstr ""
"用破坏性的巨响攻击\n"
"自己周围所有宝可梦。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:15684
msgid ""
"Locks down the battlefield\n"
"preventing escape next turn."
msgstr ""
"封锁场地，\n"
"下回合所有宝可梦不能逃走。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:15741
msgid ""
"Befriend the foe, lowering\n"
"its Attack without fail."
msgstr ""
"和对手成为朋友，\n"
"必定降低对手的攻击。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:15770
msgid ""
"Shares a secret with the\n"
"foe, lowering Sp. Atk."
msgstr ""
"和对手说悄悄话，\n"
"降低对手的特攻。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:15800
msgid ""
"Whips up a storm of\n"
"diamonds. May up Defense."
msgstr ""
"掀起钻石风暴攻击对手。\n"
"有时会大幅提高自己防御。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:15828
msgid ""
"Immerses the foe in heated\n"
"steam. May inflict a burn."
msgstr ""
"将滚烫的蒸汽喷向对手。\n"
"有时会让对手灼伤。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:15855
msgid ""
"Uses a hyperspace hole to\n"
"attack. Ignores protection."
msgstr ""
"用异次元洞攻击对手。\n"
"无视守住等招式。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:15883
msgid ""
"Hits 2-5 times with throwing\n"
"stars. Always goes first."
msgstr ""
"用水手里剑攻击2～5次。\n"
"必定能够先制攻击。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:15910
msgid ""
"Breathes a special, hot\n"
"fire. Lowers Sp. Atk."
msgstr ""
"从口中喷出特别热的火焰，\n"
"降低对手的特攻。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:15936
msgid ""
"Evades attack, and damages\n"
"the foe if struck."
msgstr ""
"防住对手的攻击。若对手\n"
"接触到自己就会受伤。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:15964
msgid ""
"Raises the Sp. Def of a\n"
"partner Pokémon."
msgstr ""
"用神奇的芳香，\n"
"提高我方宝可梦的特防。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:15993
msgid ""
"Exposes the foe to a pulse\n"
"that harshly cuts Sp. Atk."
msgstr ""
"放出奇怪的电波，\n"
"大幅降低对手的特攻。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:16020
msgid ""
"Lowers the Attack, Sp. Atk\n"
"and Speed of poisoned foes."
msgstr ""
"用特殊的毒液浇对手，降低\n"
"中毒对手的攻击、特攻和速度。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:16050
msgid ""
"Damages the foe if it uses\n"
"a Fire-type move."
msgstr ""
"对手使用火属性招式时，\n"
"会引起爆炸使其受到伤害。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:16074
msgid ""
"Raises Sp. Atk, Sp. Def and\n"
"Speed on the 2nd turn."
msgstr ""
"第1回合吸收能量，第2回合\n"
"大幅提高特攻、特防和速度。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:16106
msgid ""
"Raises the defenses of\n"
"those with Plus or Minus."
msgstr ""
"操纵磁场，提高特性为\n"
"正电或负电的宝可梦的防御。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:16137
msgid ""
"Doubles the amount of\n"
"Prize Money received."
msgstr ""
"使战斗后得到的\n"
"奖金翻倍。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:16161
msgid ""
"Electrifies the ground for\n"
"5 turns. Prevents sleep."
msgstr ""
"5回合内变成电气场地，\n"
"地面上的宝可梦不会睡着。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:16187
msgid ""
"Damages foes by emitting\n"
"a bright flash."
msgstr ""
"向对手发射强光，\n"
"给予伤害。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:16208
msgid ""
"Congratulates you on your\n"
"special day."
msgstr ""
"宝可梦在为度过特别的\n"
"日子的你送上祝福。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:16238
msgid ""
"The user and ally hold hands\n"
"making them happy."
msgstr ""
"和同伴手牵着手，\n"
"感到非常高兴。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:16268
msgid ""
"Lowers the foe's Attack\n"
"before it can move."
msgstr ""
"可爱地凝视对手，\n"
"先制降低对手的攻击。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:16295
msgid ""
"Rubs its cheeks against\n"
"the foe, paralyzing it."
msgstr ""
"将带电的脸颊蹭蹭对手，\n"
"让对手陷入麻痹。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:16369
msgid ""
"A hard punch that raises\n"
"the user's Attack."
msgstr ""
"反复出拳，\n"
"提高自己的攻击。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:16398
msgid ""
"A wave that absorbs over\n"
"half the damage inflicted."
msgstr ""
"从羽翼吸取对手的HP。\n"
"回复伤害75%的HP。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:16424
msgid ""
"Can hit a Flying foe, then\n"
"knocks it to the ground."
msgstr ""
"也能击中飞行的对手，\n"
"并使其落到地面。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:16449
msgid ""
"Those hit by the wave can\n"
"no longer escape."
msgstr ""
"用大地之波攻击。\n"
"被击中的对手不能逃走。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:16475
msgid ""
"Gathers the energy of the\n"
"land to attack every foe."
msgstr ""
"聚集大地的力量，\n"
"向对手发起攻击。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:16497
msgid ""
"Fires a great beam of light\n"
"that also hurts the user."
msgstr ""
"借用永恒之花的力量发射\n"
"光线。自己会受到不少伤害。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:16520
msgid ""
"Beams of glowing blue light\n"
"blast both foes."
msgstr ""
"用无数青白色光线\n"
"攻击对手。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:16543
msgid ""
"Fearsome blades of stone\n"
"attack both foes."
msgstr ""
"将大地的力量化为利刃\n"
"攻击对手。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:16566
msgid ""
"Drops out of the sky. This\n"
"lowers the user's defenses."
msgstr ""
"从天空俯冲攻击。自己的\n"
"防御和特防会降低。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:16595
msgid ""
"Ignores protection, but\n"
"lowers the user's Defense."
msgstr ""
"用手臂攻击，无视守住等\n"
"招式。自己的防御会降低。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:16629
msgid ""
"Restores the user's HP.\n"
"More HP in a sandstorm."
msgstr ""
"回复自己最大HP的一半。\n"
"沙暴时回复更多。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:16655
msgid ""
"Hits hard and first.\n"
"Only works first turn."
msgstr ""
"出场后立刻使出的猛击。\n"
"只能在出场第1回合使用。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:16678
msgid ""
"Protects user and poisons\n"
"foes on contact."
msgstr ""
"防住对手的攻击。若对手\n"
"接触到自己就会中毒。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:16706
msgid ""
"After being hit, a foe can\n"
"no longer escape."
msgstr ""
"在射穿对手的同时\n"
"缝住其影子，使其不能逃走。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:16731
msgid ""
"Swings the arms to strike\n"
"It ignores stat changes."
msgstr ""
"旋转手臂攻击。\n"
"无视对手的能力变化。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:16754
msgid ""
"Sings with bubbles. Cures\n"
"burns on contact."
msgstr ""
"吹出气泡攻击。\n"
"被击中的对手的灼伤会治愈。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:16810
msgid ""
"Restores the target's HP.\n"
"More HP on Grassy Terrain."
msgstr ""
"回复对手最大HP的一半。\n"
"青草场地时回复更多。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:16836
msgid ""
"Slams hard into the foe with\n"
"its entire body."
msgstr ""
"用整个身体猛烈地\n"
"撞向对手进行攻击。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:16858
msgid ""
"Restores HP equal to the\n"
"foe's Attack and lowers it."
msgstr ""
"回复与对手攻击等量的HP，\n"
"然后降低对手的攻击。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:16886
msgid ""
"Charges first turn, then\n"
"chops with a blade of light."
msgstr ""
"第1回合收集光，\n"
"第2回合用光之剑劈砍对手。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:16912
msgid ""
"Attacks with a flurry of\n"
"small leaves."
msgstr ""
"将叶片扔向对手\n"
"进行攻击。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:16933
msgid ""
"Makes the foe attack the\n"
"spotlighted Pokémon."
msgstr ""
"给宝可梦打上聚光灯，\n"
"使其成为攻击目标。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:16960
msgid ""
"Attacks with a thread that\n"
"poisons and lowers Speed."
msgstr ""
"吐出毒丝攻击。让对手\n"
"中毒并降低其速度。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:16987
msgid ""
"Guarantees the next move\n"
"will be a critical hit."
msgstr ""
"集中精神，\n"
"下次攻击必定会击中要害。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:17012
msgid ""
"Raises the offenses of\n"
"those with Plus or Minus."
msgstr ""
"启动齿轮，提高特性为\n"
"正电或负电的宝可梦的攻击。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:17043
msgid ""
"Chops the throat to disable\n"
"sound moves for 2 turns."
msgstr ""
"攻击对手的喉咙。2回合内\n"
"对手不能使用声音招式。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:17069
msgid ""
"Explodes on a foe, but\n"
"restores ally's HP."
msgstr ""
"对对手是会爆炸的花粉团，\n"
"对同伴则是回复HP的花粉团。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:17091
msgid ""
"Strangles the foe with a\n"
"chain. The foe can't escape."
msgstr ""
"用船锚缠住对手攻击。\n"
"使对手不能逃走。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:17117
msgid ""
"The ground turns weird for\n"
"5 turns. Blocks priority."
msgstr ""
"5回合内变成精神场地，\n"
"地面上的宝可梦不受先制攻击。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:17143
msgid ""
"Lunges at the foe to lower\n"
"its Attack stat."
msgstr ""
"全力猛扑对手攻击，\n"
"从而降低对手的攻击。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:17170
msgid ""
"Whips the foe with fire\n"
"lowering its Defense."
msgstr ""
"用燃烧的鞭子抽打对手，\n"
"降低对手的防御。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:17219
msgid ""
"Burns out the user fully\n"
"removing the Fire type."
msgstr ""
"燃尽自己的全部火焰，\n"
"之后不再是火属性。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:17246
msgid ""
"Swaps user's Speed with\n"
"the target's."
msgstr ""
"和对手互换\n"
"速度的数值。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:17269
msgid ""
"Hits with an accurate\n"
"horn that never misses."
msgstr ""
"用尖角刺入对手攻击。\n"
"攻击必定会命中。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:17291
msgid ""
"Cures the foe's status\n"
"to restore HP."
msgstr ""
"治愈对手的异常状态，\n"
"并回复自己的HP。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:17316
msgid ""
"Dances with mystical power.\n"
"Matches user's first type."
msgstr ""
"跳起神秘的舞蹈攻击。招式\n"
"属性与自己的第1属性相同。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:17338
msgid ""
"Hits with a ray that\n"
"nullifies the foe's Ability."
msgstr ""
"发射光线攻击。若对手已行动，\n"
"使其特性无效。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:17363
msgid ""
"An intense kick from the\n"
"tropics. Lowers Attack."
msgstr ""
"向对手使出来自南国的\n"
"猛踢。降低对手的攻击。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:17390
msgid ""
"Orders the target to use\n"
"its last move again."
msgstr ""
"命令对手\n"
"再次使用刚才使用的招式。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:17416
msgid ""
"Heats beak to attack last.\n"
"Burns foe on contact."
msgstr ""
"先加热喙再攻击。加热时\n"
"接触自己的对手会灼伤。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:17445
msgid ""
"Makes a huge noise to\n"
"attack, but lowers Defense."
msgstr ""
"摩擦鳞片发出巨响攻击。\n"
"自己的防御会降低。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:17473
msgid ""
"Swings its whole body\n"
"like a hammer to damage."
msgstr ""
"将身体当作锤子\n"
"向对手发动攻击。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:17495
msgid ""
"Violently swings around\n"
"to hurt everyone nearby."
msgstr ""
"用自己的身体狂暴地旋转，\n"
"攻击周围所有宝可梦。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:17550
msgid ""
"Sets a shell trap that\n"
"damages on contact."
msgstr ""
"设下陷阱。受到物理攻击\n"
"时陷阱爆炸造成伤害。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:17578
msgid ""
"Unleashes a strong beam,\n"
"but harshly lowers Sp. Atk."
msgstr ""
"发射强力光束。使用后\n"
"自己的特攻会大幅降低。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:17605
msgid ""
"Chomps with psychic fangs.\n"
"Destroys any barriers."
msgstr ""
"用精神力量之牙咬住对手。\n"
"还可以破坏光墙和反射壁。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:17632 src/data/moves_info.h:22016
msgid ""
"Power is doubled if the\n"
"user's previous move failed."
msgstr ""
"如果上次使用的招式\n"
"失败的话，威力会翻倍。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:17655
msgid ""
"Strikes with a haunted\n"
"bone. May lower Defense."
msgstr ""
"用寄宿灵魂的骨头殴打。\n"
"有时会降低对手的防御。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:17681
msgid ""
"Hits with a high-speed\n"
"rock that always goes first."
msgstr ""
"将石头高速撞向对手。\n"
"必定能够先制攻击。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:17703
msgid ""
"Slams the foe with water.\n"
"Can lower Defense."
msgstr ""
"用水猛撞对手。\n"
"有时会降低对手的防御。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:17730
msgid ""
"A high power laser that\n"
"forces recharge next turn."
msgstr ""
"用棱镜之力发射强烈光线。\n"
"下回合将无法动弹。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:17755
msgid ""
"Steals the target's stat\n"
"boosts, then attacks."
msgstr ""
"夺取对手的能力提升值\n"
"后再攻击对手。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:17783
msgid ""
"A sun-fueled strike that\n"
"ignores Abilities."
msgstr ""
"以流星般的气势猛撞对手。\n"
"无视对手的特性。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:17807
msgid ""
"A moon-powered beam that\n"
"ignores Abilities."
msgstr ""
"放出奇怪的光线攻击对手。\n"
"无视对手的特性。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:17830
msgid ""
"The user tears up, lowering\n"
"Attack and Sp. Atk."
msgstr ""
"泪眼汪汪地看着对手，\n"
"降低对手的攻击和特攻。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:17859
msgid ""
"An electrified impact that\n"
"can cause flinching."
msgstr ""
"撞向对手并释放出强电。\n"
"有时会使对手畏缩。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:17885
msgid ""
"Halves the foe's HP with\n"
"the power of nature."
msgstr ""
"向对手施以自然之怒，\n"
"使对手的HP减半。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:17908
msgid ""
"An attack that changes\n"
"with Memories."
msgstr ""
"随着存储碟的种类\n"
"改变招式的属性。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:17931
msgid ""
"It explodes the user's head\n"
"to damage everything around."
msgstr ""
"用自己的头爆炸攻击周围\n"
"所有宝可梦。自己也会受伤。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:17954
msgid ""
"Hits with electrical fists.\n"
"Normal moves turn Electric."
msgstr ""
"用带电的拳头攻击。使该回合\n"
"的一般属性招式变为电属性。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:17981
msgid ""
"User's highest attack stat\n"
"determines its category."
msgstr ""
"比较攻击和特攻，\n"
"用较高的一项给予伤害。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:18037
msgid ""
"A huge electrified wave that\n"
"may paralyze the foes."
msgstr ""
"用带电的巨浪攻击周围所有\n"
"宝可梦。有时会让其麻痹。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:18060
msgid ""
"Floats in air and dives at\n"
"angle. May cause flinching."
msgstr ""
"轻飘飘地浮起后俯冲攻击。\n"
"有时会使对手畏缩。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:18086
msgid ""
"Pikachu's love increases its\n"
"power. It never misses."
msgstr ""
"皮卡丘越喜欢训练家，\n"
"威力越大。攻击必定命中。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:18133
msgid ""
"Shoots a jolt of electricity.\n"
"This always paralyzes."
msgstr ""
"放出电击攻击对手。\n"
"必定会让对手麻痹。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:18155
msgid ""
"Cloaks in fire and charges.\n"
"This always inflicts a burn."
msgstr ""
"让火焰覆盖全身猛撞对手。\n"
"必定会让对手灼伤。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:18179
msgid ""
"Force puts up a wall of light\n"
"to weaken special moves."
msgstr ""
"用念力攻击，5回合内制造\n"
"减弱特殊攻击的光墙。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:18202
msgid ""
"Acts bad and puts up a wall\n"
"to weaken physical moves."
msgstr ""
"用坏坏的态度攻击，5回合内\n"
"制造减弱物理攻击的墙壁。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:18225
msgid ""
"A stalk scatters seeds\n"
"that drain HP every turn."
msgstr ""
"长出巨大的茎攻击，撒下\n"
"种子每回合吸取对手HP。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:18248
msgid ""
"Attacks with a crystal.\n"
"Eliminates all stat changes."
msgstr ""
"用冰晶攻击对手，\n"
"使场上全员的能力复原。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:18270
msgid ""
"Wraps foe with a whirlwind of\n"
"scent. Heals party's status."
msgstr ""
"用芳香的旋风包裹对手攻击，\n"
"治愈我方的异常状态。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:18293
msgid ""
"Eevee's love increases its\n"
"power. It never misses."
msgstr ""
"伊布越喜欢训练家，\n"
"威力越大。攻击必定命中。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:18313
msgid ""
"The user spins and hits with\n"
"its arms. May cause flinch."
msgstr ""
"旋转身体用双臂攻击2次。\n"
"有时会使对手畏缩。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:18343
msgid ""
"Unleashes core energy.\n"
"2x against a Dynamaxed foe."
msgstr ""
"放出核心的能量。对极巨化\n"
"的对手造成2倍伤害。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:18373
msgid ""
"The user ignores effects\n"
"that draw in moves."
msgstr ""
"无视吸引招式的特性或招式，\n"
"攻击选择的对手。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:18395
msgid ""
"Prevents the user and\n"
"the target from escaping."
msgstr ""
"用牙齿咬住对手，\n"
"使双方都不能逃走。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:18421
msgid ""
"Consumes the user's Berry,\n"
"then sharply raises Defense."
msgstr ""
"吃掉携带的树果，\n"
"大幅提高自己的防御。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:18449
msgid ""
"Raises all of the user's\n"
"stats but prevents escape."
msgstr ""
"提高自己的全部能力，\n"
"但无法逃走或替换。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:18481
msgid ""
"Lowers the foe's Speed and\n"
"makes it weak to Fire."
msgstr ""
"泼洒黏糊糊的焦油，降低对手\n"
"的速度，并使其害怕火。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:18507
msgid ""
"Magic powder changes the\n"
"target into a Psychic-type."
msgstr ""
"撒出魔法粉，\n"
"使对手变为超能力属性。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:18531
msgid ""
"The user attacks twice. Two\n"
"targets are hit once each."
msgstr ""
"用龙装弹攻击2次。若对手\n"
"有2只，则各攻击1次。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:18554
msgid ""
"All Pokémon have teatime\n"
"and eat their Berries."
msgstr ""
"举行茶会，场上的所有宝可梦\n"
"都会吃掉携带的树果。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:18578
msgid ""
"Prevents the foe's escape.\n"
"Lowers defenses every turn."
msgstr ""
"让对手不能逃走，每回合\n"
"降低对手的防御和特防。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:18599 src/data/moves_info.h:18621
msgid ""
"Power is doubled if the\n"
"user moves before the foe."
msgstr ""
"比对手先行动的话，\n"
"威力会翻倍。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:18644
msgid ""
"The user swaps effects on\n"
"either side of the field."
msgstr ""
"用神奇的力量，\n"
"交换双方场地上的效果。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:18666
msgid ""
"The user uses some of its\n"
"HP to raise all its stats."
msgstr ""
"削减少许HP，\n"
"提高自己的全部能力。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:18701
msgid ""
"Does more damage the\n"
"higher the user's Defense."
msgstr ""
"用身体撞向对手。\n"
"自己的防御越高，伤害越大。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:18725
msgid ""
"The user sharply raises the\n"
"target's Attack and Sp. Atk."
msgstr ""
"装饰对手，\n"
"大幅提高其攻击和特攻。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:18754
msgid ""
"Plays a drum to attack.\n"
"The foe's Speed is lowered."
msgstr ""
"用鼓点控制树根攻击，\n"
"降低对手的速度。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:18781
msgid ""
"Snares the target in a snap\n"
"trap for four to five turns."
msgstr ""
"用捕兽夹夹住对手，\n"
"在4～5回合内给予伤害。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:18809
msgid ""
"Launches a fiery ball at the\n"
"target. It may cause a burn."
msgstr ""
"向对手投掷火焰球攻击。\n"
"有时会让对手灼伤。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:18837
msgid ""
"Strikes as a sword. Deals 2x\n"
"damage to a Dynamaxed foe."
msgstr ""
"化身为剑劈砍对手。对极巨化\n"
"的对手造成2倍伤害。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:18864
msgid ""
"Attacks as a shield. Deals 2x\n"
"damage to a Dynamaxed foe."
msgstr ""
"化身为盾撞向对手。对极巨化\n"
"的对手造成2倍伤害。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:18890
msgid ""
"Raises Speed to attack. The\n"
"Type is based on its form."
msgstr ""
"攻击并提高自己的速度。\n"
"属性随样子而改变。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:18918
msgid ""
"Swings its tail and attacks.\n"
"This lowers Attack stats."
msgstr ""
"用坚韧的尾巴猛扫对手，\n"
"降低对手的攻击。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:18946
msgid ""
"The user pokes the target\n"
"with a pointed branch."
msgstr ""
"用尖锐的树枝\n"
"刺向对手进行攻击。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:18969
msgid ""
"The user twangs its guitar,\n"
"causing strong vibrations."
msgstr ""
"拨动吉他或贝斯，\n"
"用强烈的振动攻击。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:18993
msgid ""
"Attacks with tart apple acid\n"
"to lower the foe's Sp. Def."
msgstr ""
"用酸苹果的酸液攻击，\n"
"降低对手的特防。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:19020
msgid ""
"Drops an apple from above.\n"
"Lowers the foe's Defense."
msgstr ""
"从高处落下苹果攻击，\n"
"降低对手的防御。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:19047
msgid ""
"Attacks with spirit-breaking\n"
"force. Lowers Sp. Atk."
msgstr ""
"用势不可挡的气势攻击，\n"
"降低对手的特攻。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:19075
msgid ""
"Emits a strange steam to\n"
"potentially confuse the foe."
msgstr ""
"喷出奇怪的烟雾攻击。\n"
"有时会使对手混乱。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:19101
msgid ""
"Scatters water to restore\n"
"the HP of itself and allies."
msgstr ""
"喷洒神奇的水，\n"
"回复自己和同伴的HP。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:19128
msgid ""
"Protects itself, harshly\n"
"lowering Defense on contact."
msgstr ""
"挡住对手的攻击。若对手\n"
"接触自己，大幅降低其防御。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:19154
msgid ""
"Bows to stab the foe\n"
"with hair. It never misses."
msgstr ""
"装作低头认错，用头发刺\n"
"向对手。攻击必定会命中。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:19177
msgid ""
"Attacks with a thick leek.\n"
"The user must then rest."
msgstr ""
"用粗大的茎攻击对手。\n"
"下回合自己将无法动弹。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:19204
msgid ""
"Eternatus' strongest move.\n"
"The user rests next turn."
msgstr ""
"无极汰那最强的攻击。\n"
"下回合自己将无法动弹。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:19230
msgid ""
"Fires a beam of steel from\n"
"its body. It hurts the user."
msgstr ""
"从全身发射钢铁光束。\n"
"自己也会受到不少伤害。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:19252
msgid ""
"Power goes up and damages\n"
"all foes on Psychic Terrain."
msgstr ""
"精神场地上威力提高，\n"
"并攻击对手全体。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:19279
msgid ""
"Destroys terrain. Fails if\n"
"ground isn't terrain."
msgstr ""
"破坏场地攻击对手。\n"
"没有场地时会失败。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:19302
msgid ""
"Shoots scales 2 to 5 times.\n"
"Ups Speed, lowers Defense."
msgstr ""
"发射鳞片攻击2～5次。\n"
"提高速度，降低防御。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:19324
msgid ""
"A 2-turn move that raises\n"
"Sp. Atk before attacking."
msgstr ""
"第1回合提高特攻，\n"
"第2回合发射宇宙光束。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:19354
msgid ""
"Deals better of physical and\n"
"special damage. May poison."
msgstr ""
"比较物理和特殊，用伤害\n"
"较大的方式攻击。可能中毒。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:19379
msgid ""
"Hit everything and faint.\n"
"Powers up on Misty Terrain."
msgstr ""
"攻击周围所有宝可梦后濒死。\n"
"薄雾场地上威力提高。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:19407
msgid ""
"Gliding on ground, hits. Goes\n"
"first on Grassy Terrain."
msgstr ""
"贴地滑行攻击对手。\n"
"青草场地上必定先制。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:19430
msgid ""
"This move's power doubles\n"
"when on Electric Terrain."
msgstr ""
"电气场地上\n"
"威力会翻倍。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:19456
msgid ""
"Type and power changes\n"
"depending on the terrain."
msgstr ""
"属性和威力\n"
"随场地而改变。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:19478
msgid ""
"User skitters behind foe to\n"
"attack. Lowers foe's Sp. Atk."
msgstr ""
"从背后悄悄接近攻击，\n"
"降低对手的特攻。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:19505
msgid ""
"Foes that have stats upped\n"
"during the turn get burned."
msgstr ""
"让该回合能力提高的\n"
"对手陷入灼伤状态。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:19531
msgid ""
"If user's stats were lowered\n"
"this turn, power is doubled."
msgstr ""
"该回合自己的能力被降低\n"
"的话，威力会翻倍。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:19553
msgid ""
"Control foe's item to attack.\n"
"Fails if foe has no item."
msgstr ""
"操纵对手的道具攻击。\n"
"对手没有道具时会失败。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:19578
msgid ""
"Highly acidic gas melts items\n"
"held by surrounding Pokémon."
msgstr ""
"用强酸气体溶化周围\n"
"宝可梦所携带的道具。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:19600
msgid ""
"Properly coaches allies to\n"
"up their Attack and Defense."
msgstr ""
"进行正确的指导，提高\n"
"我方全员的攻击和防御。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:19651
msgid ""
"A 3-kick attack that gets\n"
"more powerful with each hit."
msgstr ""
"连续3次踢对手攻击。\n"
"每次命中时威力都会提高。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:19674
msgid ""
"User slams the target with\n"
"wings and hits twice in a row."
msgstr ""
"用翅膀撞击对手，\n"
"连续2次给予伤害。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:19697
msgid ""
"Throws scorching sand at\n"
"the target. May leave a burn."
msgstr ""
"将滚烫的沙子砸向对手。\n"
"有时会让对手灼伤。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:19723
msgid ""
"Heals HP and status of\n"
"itself and allies in battle."
msgstr ""
"与丛林融为一体，回复\n"
"我方全员的HP和异常状态。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:19749
msgid ""
"Mastering the Dark style,\n"
"strikes with a critical hit."
msgstr ""
"练就恶之流派的猛烈一击。\n"
"必定会击中要害。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:19774
msgid ""
"Mastering the Water style,\n"
"strikes with 3 critical hits."
msgstr ""
"练就水之流派的连打。\n"
"连续3次必定击中要害。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:19878
msgid ""
"An attack fueled by your\n"
"wrath. May cause flinching."
msgstr ""
"将愤怒转为恶之气场攻击。\n"
"有时会使对手畏缩。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:19904
msgid ""
"Uses a lightning-like kick\n"
"to hit. Lowers foe's Defense."
msgstr ""
"用雷电般的踢击攻击，\n"
"降低对手的防御。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:19932
msgid ""
"Hurls a blizzard-cloaked\n"
"icicle lance at foes."
msgstr ""
"向对手投掷包着暴风雪的\n"
"冰枪进行攻击。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:19954
msgid ""
"Sends a frightful amount\n"
"of small ghosts at foes."
msgstr ""
"发出大量的小幽灵\n"
"攻击对手。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:19976
msgid ""
"Attacks with psychic power.\n"
"Foe's last move has 3 PP cut."
msgstr ""
"用强大的念力攻击，削减\n"
"对手最后所用招式3点PP。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:20003
msgid ""
"High critical-hit ratio. May\n"
"paralyze, poison or sleep."
msgstr ""
"用毁灭之爪攻击。容易击中\n"
"要害，可能中毒、麻痹或睡眠。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:20027
msgid ""
"Hits a foe with psychic\n"
"energy. May raise Defense."
msgstr ""
"用念力能量撞击对手。\n"
"有时会提高自己的防御。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:20072
msgid "Leaves stones under the foe."
msgstr ""
"用石斧攻击，并在对手\n"
"周围散布浮游的岩石。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:20093
msgid ""
"Wraps a foe in fierce winds.\n"
"Varies with the user's form."
msgstr ""
"用强风包围对手攻击。\n"
"效果随样子而改变。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:20117
msgid ""
"A mysterious power strikes,\n"
"raising the user's Sp. Atk."
msgstr ""
"放出神秘的力量攻击。\n"
"提高自己的特攻。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:20165
msgid ""
"A slam shrouded in water.\n"
"It also hurts the user."
msgstr ""
"让水覆盖全身撞向对手。\n"
"自己也会受到不少伤害。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:20188
msgid ""
"A user-hurting blast of\n"
"amassed chlorophyll."
msgstr ""
"发射积聚的叶绿素攻击。\n"
"自己也会受到伤害。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:20205
msgid ""
"Giant chunks of ice damage\n"
"the foe. It may flinch."
msgstr ""
"将巨大的冰块砸向对手。\n"
"有时会使对手畏缩。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:20226
msgid ""
"Dances to raise Attack,\n"
"Defense and Speed."
msgstr ""
"激烈地跳起胜利之舞，\n"
"提高攻击、防御和速度。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:20256
msgid ""
"A full-body tackle. Lowers\n"
"the user's defensive stats."
msgstr ""
"用全身扑向对手。自己的\n"
"防御和特防会降低。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:20284
msgid ""
"Can poison on impact. Powers\n"
"up against a poisoned foe."
msgstr ""
"发射针刺攻击。可能中毒，\n"
"对中毒的对手威力翻倍。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:20306
msgid ""
"High critical-hit ratio.\n"
"Raises the user's Speed."
msgstr ""
"用灵力之羽攻击。容易\n"
"击中要害，提高自己速度。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:20330
msgid ""
"A spine-chilling resentment.\n"
"Lowers the foe's Attack."
msgstr ""
"用令人胆寒的怨念攻击，\n"
"降低对手的攻击。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:20352
msgid ""
"The user hardens their skin,\n"
"sharply raising its Defense."
msgstr ""
"使皮肤变得坚硬如盾，\n"
"大幅提高自己的防御。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:20376
msgid ""
"High critical-hit ratio.\n"
"May lower Defense or flinch."
msgstr ""
"容易击中要害。可能降低\n"
"对手的防御或使其畏缩。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:20403
msgid ""
"Hurts a foe harder if it has\n"
"an ailment. May leave a burn."
msgstr ""
"对异常状态的对手威力\n"
"翻倍。有时会让对手灼伤。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:20425
msgid "Leaves spikes under the foe."
msgstr ""
"用贝壳之刃攻击，并在\n"
"对手周围撒下撒菱。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:20446
msgid ""
"Hits with brutal, cold winds.\n"
"May lower foes' Speed."
msgstr ""
"用冰冷的狂风攻击。\n"
"有时会降低对手的速度。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:20470
msgid ""
"Hits with a brutal tempest.\n"
"May inflict paralysis."
msgstr ""
"用猛烈的雷云攻击。\n"
"有时会让对手麻痹。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:20493
msgid ""
"Hits with brutally hot sand.\n"
"May inflict a burn."
msgstr ""
"用灼热的沙暴攻击。\n"
"有时会让对手灼伤。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:20516
msgid ""
"The user heals and cures\n"
"itself and its ally."
msgstr ""
"回复自己和同伴的HP，\n"
"并治愈异常状态。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:20537
msgid ""
"Cures status problems and\n"
"raises offensive stats."
msgstr ""
"治愈自己的异常状态，\n"
"并提高攻击和特攻等。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:20562
msgid ""
"If the user's Terastallized,\n"
"it hits with its Tera type."
msgstr ""
"太晶化时，招式属性\n"
"变为自己的太晶属性。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:20584
msgid ""
"Protects itself, lowering\n"
"Speed on contact."
msgstr ""
"用丝制成的陷阱防住攻击。\n"
"接触的对手速度会降低。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:20605
msgid ""
"May miss and hurt the kicker.\n"
"May cause confusion."
msgstr ""
"落空的话自己会受伤。\n"
"有时会使对手混乱。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:20627
msgid ""
"This move deals more damage\n"
"for each defeated ally."
msgstr ""
"倒下的同伴越多，\n"
"威力就越大。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:20644
msgid ""
"A mind-affecting light\n"
"harshly lowers Sp. Def."
msgstr ""
"用影响精神的奇怪光线\n"
"攻击，大幅降低对手特防。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:20666
msgid ""
"Raises the user's stats\n"
"depending on Tatsugiri."
msgstr ""
"根据口中米立龙的样子，\n"
"提高自己的能力。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:20690
msgid ""
"A punch is thrown at blinding\n"
"speed to strike first."
msgstr ""
"以迅雷不及掩耳之势出拳。\n"
"必定能够先制攻击。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:20713
msgid ""
"Sharply ups target's Attack,\n"
"harshly lowers its Defense."
msgstr ""
"大幅提高对手的攻击，\n"
"大幅降低其防御。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:20740
msgid ""
"Furiously strains its legs.\n"
"Harshly lowers user's Speed."
msgstr ""
"拼命地奔跑攻击。\n"
"自己的速度会大幅降低。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:20764
msgid ""
"The user's fellows hit one\n"
"to ten times in a row."
msgstr ""
"伙伴们一起攻击，\n"
"连续击中1～10次。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:20785
msgid ""
"Ice-covered feet hit a foe\n"
"and destroy the terrain."
msgstr ""
"用包着冰的脚攻击，\n"
"并破坏场地。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:20804
msgid ""
"Foe attacks next turn can't\n"
"miss and do double damage."
msgstr ""
"攻击后到下回合对手的攻击\n"
"必定命中，且伤害翻倍。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:20826
msgid ""
"Revives a fainted party\n"
"member and heals half its HP."
msgstr ""
"复活1只濒死的我方宝可梦，\n"
"回复其一半的HP。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:20848
msgid ""
"Hurts foe every turn. Double\n"
"damage to Steel and Water."
msgstr ""
"每回合给予伤害。\n"
"对钢和水属性伤害翻倍。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:20870
msgid ""
"Hits target with splashes\n"
"of water 3 times in a row."
msgstr "用水花连续攻击对手3次。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:20889
msgid ""
"Erases trap moves and Leech\n"
"Seed. Poisons all foes."
msgstr ""
"解除束缚、撒菱等效果，\n"
"并让对手全体中毒。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:20911
msgid ""
"Changes user's and ally's\n"
"Ability into the target's."
msgstr ""
"使自己和同伴的特性\n"
"变得和对手相同。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:20931
msgid ""
"Sharply raises offenses and\n"
"Speed by using its own HP."
msgstr ""
"削减一半HP，大幅提高\n"
"攻击、特攻和速度。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:20959
msgid ""
"User slashes the foe after\n"
"kowtowing. It never misses."
msgstr ""
"下跪认错后劈砍对手。\n"
"攻击必定会命中。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:20978
msgid ""
"Rigged bouquet. Always gets\n"
"a critical hit, never missing."
msgstr ""
"抛出机关花束攻击。必定\n"
"命中，且必定击中要害。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:20996
msgid ""
"Flames scorch the target.\n"
"Raises the user's Sp. Atk."
msgstr ""
"用火焰灼烧对手。\n"
"提高自己的特攻。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:21021
msgid ""
"Hits with light, fluid dance\n"
"steps. Ups the user's Speed."
msgstr ""
"用轻快的舞步攻击。\n"
"提高自己的速度。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:21046
msgid ""
"Tackle that breaks barriers.\n"
"User's form determines type."
msgstr ""
"撞击并破坏光墙等。\n"
"属性随样子而改变。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:21069
msgid ""
"Lowers the user's Sp. Atk.\n"
"Money is recovered after."
msgstr ""
"撒出大量金币攻击。降低\n"
"特攻，战斗后可以拿到钱。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:21095
msgid ""
"Summons a ruinous disaster\n"
"and cuts half the foe's HP."
msgstr ""
"引发灾厄，\n"
"使对手的HP减半。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:21117
msgid ""
"Prehistoric explosion that's\n"
"stronger if super effective."
msgstr ""
"用远古之力冲撞对手。\n"
"效果绝佳时威力提高。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:21136
msgid ""
"Futuristic electricity. It's\n"
"stronger if super effective."
msgstr ""
"用未来之电冲撞对手。\n"
"效果绝佳时威力提高。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:21155
msgid ""
"Creates a Substitute for\n"
"itself before switching out."
msgstr ""
"削减HP制造替身，\n"
"然后和替补宝可梦替换。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:21203
msgid ""
"User tidies up hazards and\n"
"raises its Attack and Speed."
msgstr ""
"清除撒菱和替身等，\n"
"提高自己的攻击和速度。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:21259
msgid ""
"The user pounces on the foe,\n"
"lowering its Speed."
msgstr ""
"猛扑向对手攻击，\n"
"降低对手的速度。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:21283
msgid ""
"The user attacks suddenly,\n"
"raising its Speed."
msgstr ""
"突然发起攻击，\n"
"提高自己的速度。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:21311
msgid ""
"A shower with ice-cold water\n"
"lowers the target's Attack."
msgstr ""
"将冰冷的水泼向对手，\n"
"降低对手的攻击。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:21337
msgid ""
"A spinning pointed part\n"
"bypasses a foe's Protect."
msgstr ""
"旋转身体的尖锐部分攻击。\n"
"无视守住等招式。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:21357
msgid ""
"Mystical eye-beams that hit\n"
"the target twice in a row."
msgstr ""
"从双眼发射神奇的光线，\n"
"连续2次给予伤害。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:21376
msgid ""
"The more the user has been\n"
"hit, the stronger the move."
msgstr ""
"受到攻击的次数越多，\n"
"威力就越大。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:21396
msgid ""
"Shoots armor. This lowers\n"
"the user's defensive stats."
msgstr ""
"发射铠甲攻击。自己的\n"
"防御和特防会降低。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:21423
msgid ""
"A slash that absorbs\n"
"half the damage inflicted."
msgstr ""
"用剑劈砍对手。\n"
"回复伤害一半的HP。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:21447
msgid ""
"Discharges all electricity,\n"
"losing the Electric type."
msgstr ""
"放出全身的电攻击。\n"
"之后不再是电属性。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:21472
msgid ""
"Swings a huge hammer. Can't\n"
"be used twice in a row."
msgstr ""
"挥舞巨大的锤子攻击。\n"
"不能连续使用2次。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:21517
msgid ""
"Pressurized water cut with a\n"
"high critical-hit ratio."
msgstr ""
"用加压的水流切斩对手。\n"
"容易击中要害。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:21681
msgid ""
"This move's power increases\n"
"when on Electric Terrain."
msgstr ""
"在电气场地上\n"
"威力会提高。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:21705
msgid ""
"This move's power increases\n"
"under harsh sunlight."
msgstr ""
"在大晴天时威力\n"
"不会降低，反而提高。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:21723
msgid ""
"Unleashes the blood moon.\n"
"Can't be used twice in a row."
msgstr ""
"释放血月之力攻击。\n"
"不能连续使用2次。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:21741
msgid ""
"Absorbs half the damage\n"
"inflicted. May cause a burn."
msgstr ""
"喷射抹茶攻击。回复伤害\n"
"一半的HP，可能让对手灼伤。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:21768
msgid ""
"Lowers the foe's Speed\n"
"each turn for 3 turns."
msgstr ""
"泼洒糖浆攻击，3回合内\n"
"每回合降低对手的速度。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:21790
msgid ""
"Type changes with held mask.\n"
"High critical-hit ratio."
msgstr ""
"用棍棒攻击。容易击中要害。\n"
"属性随面具而改变。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:21808
msgid ""
"Gathers electricity, then\n"
"fires a high-voltage shot."
msgstr ""
"第1回合积蓄电力，\n"
"第2回合发射高压电击。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:21835
msgid ""
"In Terapagos's Stellar\n"
"Form, it hits all foes."
msgstr ""
"太乐巴戈斯星晶形态使用时\n"
"攻击对手全体。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:21856
msgid ""
"Shoots a beam of light.\n"
"Sometimes twice as strong."
msgstr ""
"发射光线攻击。\n"
"有时威力会变成2倍。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:21873
msgid ""
"Evades attack, and burns\n"
"the foe if struck."
msgstr ""
"防住对手的攻击。若对手\n"
"接触到自己就会灼伤。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:21916
msgid ""
"Wields light to cleave the\n"
"foe. Ignores protection."
msgstr ""
"用光之力劈砍对手。\n"
"无视守住等招式。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:21936
msgid ""
"Launches particle blades at\n"
"the target. Strikes twice."
msgstr ""
"发射粒子之刃，\n"
"连续2次给予伤害。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:21973
msgid ""
"Raises allies' critical-hit\n"
"ratio, sharply if Dragons."
msgstr ""
"激励同伴，使其容易击中\n"
"要害。龙属性则大幅提高。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:21992
msgid ""
"Confuses foe if its stats\n"
"were raised this turn."
msgstr ""
"对该回合能力提高的对手，\n"
"使其陷入混乱。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:22034
msgid ""
"An electrified slam. If it\n"
"misses, the user is hurt."
msgstr ""
"让电流覆盖全身猛撞对手。\n"
"落空的话自己会受伤。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:22056
msgid ""
"Sound waves that damage and\n"
"prevent healing for 2 turns."
msgstr ""
"用音波攻击。\n"
"2回合内对手不能回复HP。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:22080
msgid ""
"Makes the target flinch if\n"
"readying a priority move."
msgstr ""
"对手准备使用先制招式时\n"
"先发制人，使其畏缩。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:22101
msgid ""
"A corrosive chain attack\n"
"that may badly poison."
msgstr ""
"用腐蚀性的锁链攻击。\n"
"有时会让对手中剧毒。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:22123
msgid ""
"Builds momentum and crashes\n"
"into the foe. Power varies."
msgstr ""
"用Z力量全力冲撞对手。\n"
"威力随原招式而改变。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:22139
msgid ""
"Rams an energy orb into\n"
"the target. Power varies."
msgstr ""
"用Z力量制造能量球撞击。\n"
"威力随原招式而改变。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:22155
msgid ""
"Soars up and plummets toward\n"
"the target. Power varies."
msgstr ""
"用Z力量飞上天空俯冲撞击。\n"
"威力随原招式而改变。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:22171
msgid ""
"Sinks the target in a poison\n"
"swamp. Power varies."
msgstr ""
"用Z力量制造毒沼使对手\n"
"沉没。威力随原招式改变。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:22187
msgid ""
"Burrows deep and slams into\n"
"the target. Power varies."
msgstr ""
"用Z力量潜入地底撞击。\n"
"威力随原招式而改变。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:22204
msgid ""
"Drops a huge rock mountain\n"
"on the foe. Power varies."
msgstr ""
"用Z力量将巨大岩山砸向\n"
"对手。威力随原招式改变。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:22220
msgid ""
"Spits threads of silk to\n"
"bind the foe. Power varies."
msgstr ""
"用Z力量吐丝束缚对手。\n"
"威力随原招式而改变。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:22236
msgid ""
"Deep-seated grudges trap\n"
"the target. Power varies."
msgstr ""
"用Z力量召唤怨念困住对手。\n"
"威力随原招式而改变。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:22252
msgid ""
"Spins very fast and rams\n"
"the target. Power varies."
msgstr ""
"用Z力量高速旋转撞击。\n"
"威力随原招式而改变。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:22268
msgid ""
"Breathes intense fire at\n"
"the target. Power varies."
msgstr ""
"用Z力量喷出强烈火焰。\n"
"威力随原招式而改变。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:22284
msgid ""
"A huge whirlpool swallows\n"
"the target. Power varies."
msgstr ""
"用Z力量制造巨大漩涡吞没\n"
"对手。威力随原招式改变。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:22300
msgid ""
"Uses plant energy to attack\n"
"the target. Power varies."
msgstr ""
"用Z力量借用植物之力攻击。\n"
"威力随原招式而改变。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:22316
msgid ""
"Hits the foe with powerful\n"
"electricity. Power varies."
msgstr ""
"用Z力量释放强大电流。\n"
"威力随原招式而改变。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:22332
msgid ""
"Controls the target to\n"
"hurt it. Power varies."
msgstr ""
"用Z力量操纵对手使其受伤。\n"
"威力随原招式而改变。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:22348
msgid ""
"Drops the temperature with\n"
"Z-Power. Power varies."
msgstr ""
"用Z力量急速降低温度。\n"
"威力随原招式而改变。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:22364
msgid ""
"Develops aura and attacks\n"
"the target. Power varies."
msgstr ""
"用Z力量释放气场攻击。\n"
"威力随原招式而改变。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:22380
msgid ""
"Sucks the target into dark\n"
"energy. Power varies."
msgstr ""
"用Z力量将对手吸入暗黑。\n"
"威力随原招式而改变。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:22396
msgid ""
"Toys with the target in a\n"
"charming space. Power varies."
msgstr ""
"用Z力量在梦幻空间捉弄\n"
"对手。威力随原招式改变。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:22412
msgid ""
"Pikachu uses the max amount\n"
"of electricity and pounces."
msgstr ""
"皮卡丘使出最大电力\n"
"全力扑向对手。"

#: src/data/moves_info.h:22428
msgid ""
"Pikachu in a cap unleashes\n"
"jolt. High critical-hit rate."
msgstr ""
"戴着帽子的皮卡丘全力放电。\n"
